 a certain %s->Post permission settings','话题排序方式'=>'Topic sorting','根据权重算法排序'=>'Sort according to weight algorithm','根据帖子发布时间排序'=>'Sort by post publishing time','根据权重算法排序论是帖子的发布时间、点赞、点踩、评论等多维数据来排序，其中帖子发布时间为主要影响因子。根据帖子发布时间排序则为传统的根据帖子发布时间排序的方式'=>'According to the weight algorithm sorting theory, posts are sorted by multi-dimensional data such as posting time, likes, dislikes, and comments, among which post posting time is the main influencing factor. Sorting based on post publishing time is the traditional way of sorting based on post publishing time','话题发布之后多长时间内允许删除或编辑'=>'How long does it take for a topic to be deleted or edited after it is published','话题发布之后多长时间内允许用户自己删除或编辑，此处同时对编辑文章、编辑%s问答答案、删除评论有效。请直接填写数字，单位是分钟（如果话题处于待审状态，则没有时间限制）'=>'How long does it take for users to delete or edit a topic after it is published? This is also valid for editing articles, editing %s Q&A answers, and deleting comments. Please fill in the number directly, in minutes (if the topic is pending review, there is no time limit)','超过多少个待审话题之后不允许再发布话题'=>'After the number of pending topics is exceeded, no more topics are allowed to be published','%s中发布了超过多少个待审话题后，不允许再发布话题。'=>'After more than the number of pending topics have been published in %s, no more topics are allowed to be published。','哪些用户组允许发布提问'=>'Which user groups are allowed to post questions','创建话题和%s的权限，请前往%s用户设置%s进行设置'=>'To create topics and %s permissions, please go to %s user settings %s to set them','全部取消选择，则关闭提问功能'=>'Deselect all to close the question function','哪些用户组允许发起投票'=>'Which user groups are allowed to initiate voting','全部取消选择，则关闭投票功能'=>'Unselect all to close the voting function','哪些用户组允许发起你猜'=>'Which user groups are allowed to initiate? Guess','全部取消选择，则关闭你猜功能'=>'Deselect all to turn off the guessing function','哪些用户组允许插入卡片'=>'Which user groups are allowed to insert cards','全部取消选择，则关闭插入卡片功能'=>'Deselect all to close the card insertion function','允许哪些用户组直接发帖，不用审核'=>'Which user groups are allowed to post directly without 