er group publishes a topic, it can be set to be visible after login','哪些用户组允许设置评论可见'=>'Which user groups are allowed to set comments to be visible','选中的用户组发布话题的时候可以设置评论可见'=>'The selected user group can set comments to be visible when posting topics','哪些用户组允许设置积分可见'=>'Which user groups are allowed to set points visible','选中的用户组发布话题的时候可以设置支付积分可见'=>'When the selected user group publishes a topic, you can set the payment points to be visible','哪些用户组允许设置付费可见'=>'Which user groups are allowed to set paid visibility','选中的用户组发布话题的时候可以设置支付费用可见'=>'The selected user group can set the payment fee to be visible when posting topics','哪些用户组允许设置分组可见'=>'Which user groups allow setting groups to be visible','选中的用户组发布话题的时候可以设置只允许某些用户组可见'=>'When the selected user group publishes a topic, you can set it to only allow certain user groups to be visible','重建%s数据'=>'Rebuild %s data','重建'=>'reconstruction','请输入需要重建的%sID'=>'Please enter the %sID that needs to be rebuilt','如果您编辑了某个%s的加入权限或者修改了帖子的排序方式，请在这里重建一下%s数据，注意，如果这个%s里面的帖子比较多（超过1万条），请将%sphp的超时时间%s与%sPHP脚本内存限制改大一些%s'=>'If you have edited the joining permission of a certain %s or modified the sorting method of posts, please rebuild the %s data here. Note that if there are many posts in %s (more than 10,000), please change %sphp The timeout period %s and %sPHP script memory limit should be changed to a larger value %s','数据重建成功。'=>'Data reconstruction is successful。','请前往%s购买卡密，然后回到此处进行充值'=>'Go to %s and then back here to recharge','点点赞赏，手留余香'=>'Give the author an award as an encouragement','还没有人赞赏，快来当第一个赞赏的人吧！'=>'No one Reward author yet, come and be the first one！','这是一个描述信息'=>'This is a description','无限制'=>'Unlimite','有效'=>'Valid','过期'=>'expired','天'=>'Days','优惠劵ID'=>'Coupon ID','领取过期时间'=>'Collection Expiration Time','使用过期时间'=>'Using Expiration Time','允许领取用户组'=>'Allow receiving user groups','允许使用的商品分类'=>'Allowed product categories','允许使用的商品'=>'Allowed products','支付设置'=>'payment Options','支付金额'=>'Payment Amount','如果是固定金额，或者需要用户选择支付金额，请将金额填到此