er page','综合设置'=>'Comprehensive settings','邀请管理'=>'Invitation management','注册时邀请码是否必填'=>'Is the invitation code required when registering','不使用邀请码'=>'No invitation code','用户使用邀请码注册后，是否自动关联推广'=>'Whether or not a promotion is automatically associated after a user registers with an invitation code','在推广功能开启的状态下，打开此项就可以自关联用户之间的推广关系'=>'When the promotion function is on, you can turn on this item to self-associate the promotion relationship between users.','邀请码获取链接'=>'Link to the invitation code','此项内容显示在注册窗口，邀请码填写窗口格式如下：%s。%s比如：%s'=>'This content is displayed in the registration window. The format of the invitation code filling window is as follows: %s. %sFor example: %s','是否给注册用户发放邀请码'=>'Whether to issue invitation codes to registered users','前期站点推广的时候极为有效，建议开启'=>'It is extremely effective in early site promotion and is recommended to be turned on','是'=>'Yes','否'=>'No','给注册用户发放邀请码的数量'=>'The number of invitation codes issued to registered users','不要太多，不然用户不知道珍惜，默认3个'=>'Don\'t do too much, otherwise users won\'t cherish, default 3','发放邀请码的奖励值'=>'Reward value for issuing invitation code','给用户发放邀请码的奖励值'=>'The reward value for issuing invitation codes to users','邀请码生成'=>'Invitation code generation','生成邀请码的数量'=>'Number of invitation codes generated','奖励的积分'=>'Points awarded','用户通过邀请码注册之后会得到的积分奖励（奖励给通过邀请码注册的人）'=>'The points reward that users will receive after registering through the invitation code (awarded to those who register through the invitation code)','邀请码创建人'=>'Invitation code creator','如果需要指定邀请码创建人，请填写创建人的用户ID，邀请码生成成功之后会进入该创建人的邀请码列表中。如果创建人是当前管理员，请直接填0'=>'If you need to specify the creator of the invitation code, please fill in the user ID of the creator. After the invitation code is successfully generated, it will enter the invitation code list of the creator. If the creator is the current administrator, please fill in 0 directly','邀请码生成成功， 请前往%s查看。'=>'The invitation code was generated successfully, please go to %s to view it。','邀请码管理'=>'Invitation code management','