不显示'=>'Lack of sorting, not displayed in the foreground','问题'=>'Question','答主'=>'Respondent','问题不存在'=>'The problem does not exist','请先激活主题再导入数据'=>'Please activate the theme first before importing data','B2主题设置'=>'B2 theme settings','未安装扩展，请按照下面的方法进行安装'=>'The extension is not installed, please follow the steps below to install it','1、打开您的php.ini文件（%s）'=>'1. Open your php.ini file (%s)','2、将下面的代码复制到php.ini文件的最后一行保存：%s'=>'2, the following code will be copied to the last line of the php.ini file to save: %s','3、重启php'=>'3. Restart php','4、刷新本页'=>'4、Refresh this page','2、php.ini底部找一下，如果以前添加过类似%s这样的代码，先将其删掉，如果没有就下一步'=>'2, php.ini bottom to look for, if previously added similar to %s such code, the first to delete it, if not on the next step','3、将下面的代码复制到php.ini文件的最后一行保存：%s'=>'3, the following code will be copied to the last line of the php.ini file to save: %s','4、重启php'=>'4. Restart php','5、刷新本页'=>'5、Refresh this page','感谢您使用B2主题'=>'Thank you for using B2 theme','主题升级'=>'Theme Upgrade','当前主题版本为：'=>'The current theme version is:','您的会员号是：'=>'Your member number is:','检查更新'=>'Check for updates','点击升级到最新版'=>'Click to upgrade to the latest version','更新中，请等待完成'=>'Update in progress, please wait for completion','设置项导出'=>'Export settings','导出B2主题设置项'=>'Export B2 theme settings','%s如果您的主题已经设置完毕，或者有其他重要的设置需要变更，建议及时导出.%s只限B2主题的设置项和小工具，不包括文章、分类设置、订单、卡密、邀请码等数据%s'=>'%sIf your theme has been set up, or there are other important settings that need to be changed, it is recommended to export them in time. %sOnly the setting items and gadgets of the B2 theme, excluding articles, category settings, orders, card passwords, and invitation codes Waiting for data %s','设置项导入'=>'Import settings','导入B2主题设置项'=>'Import B2 theme settings','1、导入的设置项将会替换原有的设置项，请谨慎操作。导入的文件格式为.txt'=>'1. The imported settings will replace the original settings, so please operate with caution. The imported file format is .txt','2、如果您已有设置好的项目，请先导出备份一下。导出的文件格式为.txt'=>'2、If you have already set up a good project, please export the backup first. Exported file format is .txt','请仔细阅读说明'=>'Please read the instructions carefully','菜单形式'=>'menu form','下拉菜单'=>'Drop-down menu','列表菜单'=>'List menu','图片菜单'=>'Picture menu','分类菜单'=>'Category menu','菜单颜色'=>'menu color','请选择菜单的颜色'=>'Please select a menu color','菜单图片（图标）'=>'Menu pictures (icons)','请选择菜单图片（图标）,在选择图片菜单模式下将会显示在菜单中'=>'Please select the menu picture (icon), which will be displayed in the menu in the select picture menu mode','%s首页封面图片'=>'%s home page cover picture','%s首页描述'=>'%sHome page description','显示在%s封面之上，%s标题之下，其他%s标签的封面图，请前往%s设置'=>'Displayed above the cover of %s, under the title of %s, and for cover images of other %s tags, please go to %s settings','%s首页SEO标题'=>'%sHome page SEO title','发布%s待选标签'=>'Publish %s candidate tags','用户在发布%s的时候可以选择这些待选的标签，请直接输入%s标签的名称，多个标签用英文逗号隔开'=>'Users can select these candidate tags when publishing %s. Please directly enter the name of the %s tag. Multiple tags are separated by commas','%s每页显示多少篇最新%s'=>'%sHow many latest articles are displayed on each page %s','%s投票文字(利好)'=>'%s voting text (good)','%s投票文字(利空)'=>'%s voting text (bad)','哪些用户可以直接发布，不用审核'=>'Which users can publish directly without review','建议只选择特定级别的用户，以免出现乱发广告的情况，除此之外，管理员和编辑默认也不需要审核'=>'It is recommended to only select users of a specific level to avoid random advertising. In addition, administrators and editors do not need to review by default','欢迎您来到本站！'=>'Welcome to our site！','综合'=>'hybrid','常规设置'=>'General settings','是否开启简洁模式'=>'Whether to enable simple mode','如果您不需要站点有类似，登陆、注册、评论等交互功能，可以开启简洁模式，将只显示文章，没有交互。'=>'If you do not need the site to have interactive functions such as login, registration, and comments, you can turn on the simple mode, which will only display articles without interaction。','开启简洁模式'=>'Turn on simple mode','关闭简洁模式'=>'Turn off compact mode','开启主题自带缓存'=>'Turn on the theme\'s own cache','当您使用了redis 或者 memcached 这类数据缓存时，主题将自动对查询和计算量比较大的代码进行结果的缓存%s实际使用过程中建议开启。%s调试主题，修改代码等情况下建议关闭,修改完成即可开启（修改代码以后请在缓存插件中清空一下缓存）'=>'When you use data caching such as redis or memcached, the theme will automatically cache the results of codes with large query and calculation loads. %s It is recommended to turn it on during actual use. %s It is recommended to close the debugging theme, modify the code, etc., and turn it on after the modification is completed (please clear the cache in the cache plug-in after modifying the code)','开启主题自带SEO'=>'Turn on the theme and come with SEO','如果您需要使用某些SEO插件，请关闭主题自带的SEO功能，以免产生冲突'=>'If you need to use some SEO plugins, please turn off the theme comes with the SEO function to avoid conflicts','图片LOGO（深色）'=>'Picture LOGO (dark)','某些顶部背景为白色的情况下使用，建议使用%s格式的图片，以适应高分辨率屏幕。%s如果不设置图片LOGO，网站将显示下面设置的文字LOGO。'=>'Sometimes when the top background is white, it is recommended to use pictures in %s format to fit the high-resolution screen. %s If you do not set a picture LOGO, the website will display the text LOGO set below。','选择LOGO'=>'Choose LOGO','图片LOGO（浅色）'=>'Picture LOGO (light color)','某些顶部透明的风格下使用，也会视频播放器右上角显示，建议使用%s格式的图片，以适应高分辨率屏幕。%s如果不设置图片LOGO，网站将显示下面设置的文字LOGO。'=>'Used in some transparent styles at the top, it will also be displayed in the upper right corner of the video player. It is recommended to use pictures in %s format to Adapt to high-resolution screens. If %s does not set a picture LOGO, the website will display the text LOGO set below。','文字LOGO'=>'Text LOGO','默认为您的站点名，您也可以自定义该名称，只在页面顶部显示。'=>'Defaults to your site name, but you can customize it to only appear at the top of the page。','默认缩略图'=>'Default thumbnail','可以设置多个默认缩略图，当您的文章没有指定缩略图，并且文章内部没有图片的时候，随机显示这些缩略图。'=>'You can set multiple default thumbnails, when your article does not specify a thumbnail, and there is no picture inside the article, randomly display these thumbnails。','视频播放器默认缩略图'=>'Video player default thumbnail','当您未设置视频封面的时候默认显示此封面。'=>'This cover is displayed by default when you do not set a video cover。','弹窗背景图'=>'Pop-up window background image','登陆、注册、支付等弹窗顶部有一个背景图片，您可以在此更换此图片。'=>'There is a background image at the top of the pop-up windows for login, registration, payment, etc. You can change this image here。','网站代币符号'=>'Website Token Symbol','网站的代币符号，默认%s。'=>'The token symbol of the website, default is %s。','网站货币名称'=>'Website currency name','比如%s等，或者其他您觉得符合您站点气质的名称。'=>'For example, %s, etc., or other names that you think match the temperament of your site。','代币'=>'Token','余额'=>'Balance','标题连接符'=>'title link','标题与描述之间的分隔符，默认%s。'=>'Separator between title and description, default %s。','标题连接符前后是否去掉空格'=>'Whether to remove spaces before and after title connectors','一些朋友的原始数据中是没有连接符的，此功能为了保留原始的标题格式，以免被SEO降权。'=>'Some of our friends have raw data without ligatures, this feature is designed to preserve the original title format to avoid being downgraded by SEO.','保留空格'=>'Retain spaces','去掉空格'=>'Remove the spaces.','分类目录是否去掉category标签'=>'Whether to remove the category tag from the category directory','如果您之前的分类链接里面有%s标签，此时去掉可能影响之前的收录。%s设置完成以后，请重新保存一下固定链接'=>'If your previous category link has the %s label, removing it at this time may affect the previous collection. When the %s setting is complete，please save the permalink again','去掉category'=>'Remove category','保留category'=>'keep category','首页SEO关键词'=>'Homepage SEO Keywords','建议使用英文的%s隔开，一般3-5个关键词即可，多了会有堆砌嫌疑。'=>'It is recommended to use English %s to separate them. Generally, 3-5 keywords are enough. If there are too many, it will be suspected of stacking。','首页SEO描述'=>'Homepage SEO description','描述你站点的主营业务，一般不超过200个字。'=>'Describe the main business of your site, generally no more than 200 words。','头部HTML标签'=>'Header HTML tag','你可以添加站点的%s等标签，通常情况下，这里是用来放置第三方台验证站点所有权时使用的。'=>'You can add tags such as %s of the site. Usually, this is used to place a third-party station to verify site ownership。','底部HTML标签'=>'Bottom HTML tag','你可以添加站点的%s等标签，通常情况下，这里是用来加载额外的JS、css文件，或者放置统计代码。'=>'You can add tags such as %s of the site, usually, this is used to load additional JS, css files, or put set statistical code。','名称及连接'=>'Name and connection','【专题】名称'=>'【Topic】Name','【专题】连接别名'=>'【Topic】Connect alias','【圈子】名称'=>'【Circle】Name','【圈主】名称'=>'【Circle Owner】Name','【圈友】名称'=>'【Circle Friend】Name','【圈子】连接别名'=>'【Circle】Connect alias','【商铺】名称'=>'【Shop】Name','【商铺】连接别名'=>'【Shop】Connect alias','【快讯】名称'=>'【News】Name','【快讯】连接别名'=>'【News】Connect alias','【文档】名称'=>'【file name','【文档】连接别名'=>'[Document] Connection alias','【公告】名称'=>'【Announcement】Name','【公告】连接别名'=>'【Announcement】Connect alias','【网址导航】名称'=>'【Website Navigation】Name','【网址导航】连接别名'=>'【Website navigation】Connect alias','【供求信息】名称'=>'【Supply and Demand Information】Name','【供求信息】连接别名'=>'【Supply and demand information】Connect alias','【供求信息】中的<供>自定义名称'=>'<Supply> custom name in [Supply and Demand Information]','【供求信息】中的<求>自定义名称'=>'<Demand> custom name in [Supply and Demand Information]','【问答】名称'=>'[Q&A] Name','【问答板块】名称'=>'[Q&A Board] Name','【问题回答】名称'=>'[Answer to the question] Name','【问答】连接别名'=>'【Q&A】Connect alias','安全'=>'Secure','是否开启百度文本审查功能'=>'Whether to enable Baidu text review function','站点中所有用户需要输入的文本都将经过AI文本审查功能进行过滤，避免涉黄、涉敏感、涉广告等违规内容的发布。%s1、请前往%s百度AI开放平台%s开通账户。%s2、控制面板的【内容审核】中创建应用，只勾选内容审核相关的。%s3、将生成的appid，API Key，Secret Key填入下方。%s免费用户拥有5万次的免费API调用，每秒并发2QPS'=>'All text that users need to enter on the site will be filtered by the AI text review function to avoid the release of pornographic, sensitive, advertising and other illegal content. %s1. Please go to %sBaidu AI open platform %s to open an account. %s2. Create an application in [Content Audit] in the control panel, and only check the ones related to content audit. %s3. Fill in the generated appid, API Key, and Secret Key below. %s free users have 50,000 free API calls, with 2QPS concurrency per second','AppId'=>'AppId','百度智能云控制面板->内容审核->你创建的应用->AppId'=>'Baidu Smart Cloud Control Panel->Content Review->Apps you created->AppId','API Key'=>'API 密钥','百度智能云控制面板->内容审核->你创建的应用->API Key'=>'Baidu Smart Cloud Control Panel->Content Review->Applications you created->API Key','Secret Key'=>'Secret Key','百度智能云控制面板->内容审核->你创建的应用->Secret Key'=>'Baidu Smart Cloud Control Panel->Content Review->Applications you created->Secret Key','%s限制操作频次（需要开启了redis 或者 memcached）%s%s此功能用来防止某些人通过接口批量对数据进行操作，比如批量发送垃圾信息，批量下载，批量硬解密码等操作%s%s如果您不知道下面的设置项是什么意思，请保持默认即可%s'=>'%sLimit the frequency of operations (redis or memcached needs to be enabled)%s%sThis function is used to prevent some people from batch operations on data through the interface, such as batch sending spam messages, batch downloads, batch hard decryption of passwords, etc.%s %sIf you don’t know what the following setting items mean, please keep the defaults%s','记录时间段'=>'Recording time period','记录这个时间段的用户操作，如果这个时间段用户操作次数超过某个数值，将会触发限制。请直接填写数字，比如记录10秒内的操作，直接填写数字10'=>'Record user operations during this period. If the number of user operations during this period exceeds a certain value, a limit will be triggered. Please fill in the number directly. For example, to record operations within 10 seconds, fill in the number 10 directly','操作频次'=>'Operation frequency','上面时间段内用户操作的频次超过多少次以后触发限制。比如：上面时间段填的是10秒，这里操作频次填的是5次，则代表，用户10秒内操作某个数据超过5次以后触发限制。'=>'The limit will be triggered after the frequency of user operations exceeds the number of times in the above time period. For example: the time period filled in above is 10 seconds, and the operation frequency filled here is 5 times, which means that the limit will be triggered after the user operates a certain data more than 5 times within 10 seconds。','加入小黑屋的时间'=>'Time to join the black room','通过上面的机制触发限制，这个限制是将此用户加入小黑屋。请在这里填写加入小黑屋的时间，单位是天。如果只想将他加入小黑屋1个小时，那么就是1/24=0.042，直接填写0.042即可。'=>'The restriction is triggered through the above mechanism. This restriction is to add this user to the black room. Please fill in the time to join the Black Room here, the unit is days. If you only want to add him to the black room for 1 hour, then 1/24=0.042, just fill in 0.042。','%s限制3小时内提交数据总量（需要开启了redis 或者 memcached）%s%s此功能用来防止某些人通过接口批量对数据进行操作，比如批量发送垃圾信息，批量上传，批量硬解密码等操作%s%s如果您不知道下面的设置项是什么意思，请保持默认即可。（管理员不受此限制）%s'=>'%sLimits the total amount of data submitted within 3 hours (redis or memcached needs to be turned on) %s%sThis function is used to prevent some people from batch operations on data through the interface, such as batch sending spam, batch uploading, and batch hard decoding. Password and other operations%s%sIf you don’t know what the following setting items mean, please keep the default. (Administrators are not subject to this restriction) %s','3小时内发布文章、评论、快讯、帖子等总量'=>'The total number of articles, comments, news, posts, etc. published within 3 hours','直接填写数字，比如20'=>'Fill in the number directly, such as 20','3小时内上传文件的总量'=>'Total number of files uploaded within 3 hours','文件包含图片、视频、或者其他wp允许上传的文件类型，3小时内超过此数量，将不再允许上传。请直接填写数字，比如20'=>'The file contains pictures, videos, or other file types that WP allows to upload. If the number exceeds this number within 3 hours, uploading will no longer be allowed. Please fill in the number directly, such as 20','同一个IP，1小时内限制注册多少次'=>'The same IP is limited to how many times it can be registered within one hour','超过次数将不再允许注册，此功能可防止有人使用临时邮箱批量注册的现象'=>'Registration will no longer be allowed if the number of times is exceeded. This feature can prevent people from using temporary email addresses to register in batches','%s消息表自动清理%s%s消息表用来记录用户的消息数据，包括积分和%s记录，用户比较多的时候数据量可能会很大，如果消息表（zrz_message）数据比较庞大，可根据自身情况设置清理多少天前的数据。%s'=>'%s message table automatically cleans %s. The %s message table is used to record user message data, including points and %s records. When there are many users, the amount of data may be large. If the message table (zrz_message) data is relatively large, you can Set how many days old data to clean according to your own situation. %s','清理多少天之前的数据'=>'How many days old data should be cleaned','请直接填写天数数字。设置好之后，您需要点击主题激活按钮，才会执行。之后每次激活都会检查过期数据，并清理。如果不需要清理，请填0。'=>'Please fill in the number of days directly. After setting up, you need to click the theme activation button to execute it. Each subsequent activation will check expired data and clean it up. If no cleaning is required, please fill in 0。','登录与注册'=>'Login and registration','是否开启注册'=>'Whether to enable registration','建议将wp设置->常规中的<任何人都可以注册>的勾选项去掉，防止机器人注册。'=>'It is recommended to remove the checkbox from <People can register> in ‘wp settings-> General’ to prevent robot registration。','登陆时效'=>'Login time limit','用户登陆之后将会有一段时间保持登陆状态，这里可以设置登陆状态的时效，出于安全考虑，一般不超过7天。'=>'After the user logs in, the user will remain logged in for a period of time. Here you can set the time limit for the login status. For security reasons, it generally does not exceed 7 days。','是否开启cookie兼容模式'=>'Whether to enable cookie compatibility mode','不知道干啥用的，请关闭，不用开启。如果您使用了一些插件，涉及到用户登录的情况，请开启此项。'=>'I don’t know what it is used for, please turn it off, don’t turn it on. If you use some plug-ins that involve user login, please enable this。','隐私政策网址'=>'Privacy Policy URL','如果设置将会显示在登录框底部，请直接填写网址'=>'If the settings will be displayed at the bottom of the login box, please fill in the URL directly','用户协议网址'=>'User Agreement URL','请选择身份验证形式'=>'Please select a form of authentication','手机验证'=>'SMS verification','邮箱验证'=>'Email Authentication','手机和邮箱均可验证'=>'Mobile or email can be verified','主题自带图形验证'=>'The theme comes with graphic verification','Luosimao人机验证'=>'Luosimao human-machine verification','用于注册，找回密码等操作，四种身份验证形式只能选择其中一种。
            %s如果选择包含邮箱验证，请确认服务器支持邮件发送功能，如果服务器不支持邮件发送，推荐安装%s插件去支持。
            %s如果选择了包含手机验证，请按照下面的提示进行短信设置。
            %s如果选择Luosimao验证，请前往%s申请，然后将%s和%s填入下面设置项中。
            '=>'For registration, password retrieval and other operations, only one of the four forms of authentication can be selected. 
 If %s chooses to include mailbox verification, please confirm that the server supports the mail sending function, if the server Mail sending is not supported, it is recommended to install the %s plugin to support it. 
 %s If you choose to include mobile phone verification, please follow the prompts to set up SMS. 
 %s If you choose Luosimao verification, please go to %s to apply, then fill %s and %s into the settings below. ','luosimao人机验证设置'=>'luosimao human-machine authentication settings','Site key'=>'Site key','luosimao后台->人机验证->操作->设置。'=>'luosimao background-> Human-machine verification-> Operation-> Settings。','Api key'=>'API key','请选择手机短信服务商'=>'Please select a mobile SMS service provider','阿里云'=>'Ali Cloud','云片'=>'clouds','聚合'=>'aggregate','中正云'=>'Zhongzheng Cloud','腾讯云'=>'Tencent Cloud','赛邮云'=>'Saiyouyun','其他'=>'Other','阿里云短信设置'=>'Alibaba Cloud SMS settings','AccessKey Id'=>'AccessKeyId','阿里云控制台->鼠标放到右上角头像上->accessKeys->AccessKey ID。'=>'Alibaba Cloud Console->Mouse over the avatar in the upper right corner->accessKeys->AccessKey ID。','Access Key Secret'=>'Access Key Secret','阿里云控制台->鼠标放到右上角头像上->accessKeys->Access Key Secret。'=>'Alibaba Cloud Console->Mouse over the avatar in the upper right corner->accessKeys->Access Key Secret。','签名名称'=>'Signature','阿里云控制台->短信服务控制台->国内消息->签名管理->签名名称。'=>'Alibaba Cloud Console->SMS Service Console->Domestic Messages->Signature Management->Signature Name。','模板CODE'=>'TemplateCODE','阿里云控制台->短信服务控制台->国内消息->模板管理->模板CODE。'=>'Alibaba Cloud Console -> SMS Service Console -> Domestic Messages -> Template Management -> Template CODE。','云片短信设置'=>'Yunpian SMS settings','Apikey'=>'Apike','云片管理控制台->账户设置->子账户管理。'=>'Yunpi Management Console->Account Settings->Sub-account Management。','模板内容'=>'Template content','云片管理控制台->国内短信->签名模板报备->已审核的【模板内容】%s
            比如：%s'=>'Yunpian Management Console->Domestic SMS->Signature Template Report->Audited [Template Content] %s
             For example: %s','腾讯云短信设置'=>'Tencent Cloud SMS settings','短信模板ID'=>'SMS template ID','模板 ID，必须填写已审核通过的模板 ID。模板ID可登录 腾讯短信控制台->国内短信->正文模板->ID 中查看'=>'Template ID, the approved template ID must be filled in. The template ID can be viewed in Tencent SMS Console->Domestic SMS->Text Template->ID','短信签名内容'=>'SMS signature content','短信签名内容，签名信息可登录 腾讯短信控制台->国内短信->签名管理->内容 中查看。'=>'SMS signature content, signature information can be viewed in Tencent SMS Console->Domestic SMS->Signature Management->Content。','短信SDK AppID'=>'SMS SDK AppID','短信SdkAppid在 短信控制台 应用管理->应用列表，示例如1400006666。'=>'The SMS SdkAppid is in the SMS Console Application Management->Application List, for example, 1400006666。','短信App Key'=>'SMS App Key','短信SdkAppid在 短信控制台 应用管理->应用列表，示例如e0410cfd6568dc827c2c5ac7b7c38851。'=>'The SMS SdkAppid is in the SMS console Application Management->Application List, for example, e0410cfd6568dc827c2c5ac7b7c38851。','通用短信接口'=>'Universal SMS interface','接口网址'=>'Interface URL','比如：http://xxx.com/sms?username=%s&password=%s&phone=%s&message=【柒比贰】您的验证码是%s。如非本人操作，请忽略本短信'=>'For example: http://xxx.com/sms?username=%s&password=%s&phone=%s&message=【淒bi二】Your verification code is %s. If it is not done by yourself, please ignore this message','其中红色部分是你要根据不同平台自己设置的，可能参数不止这两个。绿色部分是程序会自动添加的，请保持不要修改。'=>'The red part is what you need to set according to different platforms. There may be more than these two parameters. The green part is automatically added by the program, please do not modify it。','短信内容是否需要urldecode,'=>'Whether the content of the SMS needs to be urldecode,','不使用'=>'Do not use','不同平台要求不同,请查看您使用平台的接口文档中是否要求短信内容urlencode'=>'Different platforms have different requirements, please check whether the SMS content urlencode is required in the interface document of the platform you are using','成功发送短信，返回代码'=>'SMS sent successfully, return code','短信发送成功或失败对方服务器通常都会返回一些信息，请直接填写发送成功之后返回有别于失败的特殊字符串。比如发送成功后返回的信息中包括success这个字符，发送失败不会有这个字符，那么请在这里填写success'=>'The other party\'s server will usually return some information whether the SMS is successfully sent or failed. Please directly fill in the special string that will be returned after successful sending and different from failed. For example, the information returned after successful transmission includes the character "success". If the transmission fails, this character will not be included. Then please fill in the "success" character here','赛邮短信设置'=>'Saimail SMS settings','APPID应用ID'=>'APPID application ID','登录后创建网址：https://www.mysubmail.com/chs/sms/apps'=>'Create a URL after logging in: https://www.mysubmail.com/chs/sms/apps','APPKEY应用密匙'=>'APPKEY application key','模板标记'=>'template tag','登录后创建网址：https://www.mysubmail.com/chs/sms/templates'=>'Create a URL after logging in: https://www.mysubmail.com/chs/sms/templates','Sign Type验证模式'=>'Sign Type verification mode','1.md5=md5 签名验证模式[推荐]<br>2.sha1=sha1 签名验证模式[推荐]<br>3.normal=密匙明文验证'=>'1.md5=md5 signature verification mode [recommended]<br>2.sha1=sha1 signature verification mode [recommended]<br>3.normal=key plain text verification','中正云短信设置'=>'Zhongzheng Cloud SMS settings','中正云账户'=>'Zhongzheng Cloud Account','中正云密码'=>'Zhongzheng cloud password','中正云模板'=>'Zhongzheng Cloud Template','比如：%s'=>'For example: %s','聚合短信设置'=>'Aggregated SMS settings','模板ID'=>'Template ID','我的聚合->短信API服务->短信模板->模板ID。'=>'My Aggregation->SMS API Service->SMS Template->Template ID。','Appkey'=>'Appkey','数据中心->我的数据->AppKey。'=>'Data Center->My Data->AppKey。','社交登录强制绑定手机、邮箱或用户名'=>'Social login is forcibly bound to mobile phone, email or username','第三方社交注册并未要求用户填写手机号码或邮箱，如果需要强制绑定手机或邮箱，请开启，绑定的是手机、邮箱还是用户名，与上面选择的身份验证形式一致。'=>'Third-party social registration does not require users to fill in their mobile phone number or email address. If you need to forcibly bind your mobile phone or email address, please turn it on. The binding is your mobile phone, email address or username, which is consistent with the identity verification form selected above。','不要求绑定'=>'No binding required','强制绑定'=>'Force binding','新注册用户消息提示'=>'Message prompt for newly registered users','新用户注册成功以后，会在消息中心有一条新的消息，请在此设置新消息内容'=>'After the new user registers successfully, there will be a new message in the message center. Please set the new message content here','邮箱注册白名单'=>'Email registration whitelisting','如果此白名单不为空，用户只允许白名单中的邮箱注册。每个邮箱占一行，例如%s'=>'If this whitelist is not empty, the user is only allowed to register mailboxes in the whitelist. Each mailbox takes up one line, e.g. %s','邮箱注册黑名单'=>'Email Registration Blacklist','如果此黑名单不为空，黑名单中的邮箱地址将不允许注册。每个邮箱占一行，例如%s'=>'If this blacklist is not empty, email addresses in the blacklist will not be allowed to register. Each e-mail address takes up one line, e.g. %s','登录窗口只显示微信登录？'=>'Login window only shows WeChat login?','微信登录设置'=>'WeChat login settings','优先微信登录'=>'Priority WeChat Login','开启后，登录窗口优先显示微信登陆二维码（只对微信官方有效，彩虹聚合登录不支持直接显示二维码）'=>'After opening, the login window displays the QR code of WeChat login in priority (only valid for WeChat official, Rainbow Aggregator login does not support displaying the QR code directly)','是否启用微信PC扫码登录（微信开放平台PC扫码登陆）'=>'Whether to enable WeChat PC scan code login (WeChat open platform PC scan code login)','微信pc端登录设置'=>'WeChat PC login settings','请注意，如果您开通了微信开放平台，并且添加了网站应用，此处开启才有效，否则请保持关闭'=>'Please note that if you have opened the WeChat open platform and added a website application, it will only be effective if you enable it here. Otherwise, please keep it closed','AppID'=>'AppID','微信开放平台网站应用的AppID'=>'AppID of WeChat open platform website application','AppSecret'=>'AppSecret','微信开放平台网站应用的AppSecret'=>'AppSecret for WeChat open platform website application','微信扫码登录申请地址：%s；回调地址请填写：%s'=>'WeChat scan code login application address: %s ; Callback address please fill in: %s','是否启用微信公众号内授权登录'=>'Whether to enable authorized login within WeChat Public','微信公众号登录设置'=>'WeChat public account login settings','微信公众平台->基本配置->开发者ID(AppID)'=>'WeChat public platform-> Basic configuration-> Developer ID (AppID)','微信公众平台->基本配置->开发者密码'=>'WeChat public platform-> Basic configuration-> Developer password','公众号授权登录，请开通微信服务号（必须认证了的服务号），微信订阅号无法使用'=>'To log in with the official account authorization, please open a WeChat service account (a service account that must be authenticated). WeChat subscription accounts cannot be used','是否开启PC端扫码关注公众号后自动登录？'=>'Do you want to open the PC scan code and follow the WeChat public account to log in automatically？','扫码关注自动登录'=>'Scan code to follow then login automatically','开启此项，用户点击微信登录会直接显示公众号二维码，用户扫码关注以后自动登录。开启条件：1、关闭上面“微信PC扫码登录”;2、开通了微信服务号并在主题%s常规设置->微信设置%s里面填写了相关设置项。'=>'When this option is turned on, the user clicks on WeChat to log in and the official account QR code will be directly displayed. The user will automatically log in after scanning the code and following it. Opening conditions: 1. Turn off the "WeChat PC scan QR code login" above; 2. Open a WeChat service account and fill in the relevant setting items in the topic %s General Settings -> WeChat Settings %s。','关注公众号登录后微信提示文字'=>'Follow the WeChat prompt text after logging in to the official account','用户通过关注公众号登录网站后，微信内可以返回一段文字，此处为文字内容'=>'After the user logs in to the website by following the official account, a piece of text can be returned in WeChat. Here is the text content','是否开启微信端用户进入网站提示授权（已授权自动登录）？'=>'Whether to enable WeChat users to be prompted for authorization when entering the website (automatic login if authorized) ？','微信端自动登录'=>'Automatic login on WeChat','务必设置了上面<微信公众号登录设置>，才会生效！否则请关闭'=>'Be sure to set the above <WeChat official account login settings> for it to take effect! Otherwise please close','是否启用QQ授权登录'=>'Whether to enable QQ authorization login','QQ登录设置'=>'QQ login settings','APP ID'=>'APP ID','APP Key'=>'APP Key','QQ登录申请地址：%s；回调地址请填写：%s'=>'QQ login application address: %s; Callback address please fill in: %s','是否启用微博授权登录'=>'Whether to enable Weibo authorized login','微博设置'=>'Weibo settings','App Key'=>'App Key','App Secret'=>'App Secret','微博登录申请地址：%s；回调地址和取消回调地址都填写：%s'=>'Weibo login application address: %s; Both the callback address and cancellation callback address are filled in: %s','是否启用彩虹聚合登录'=>'Whether to enable rainbow aggregation login','彩虹聚合登录'=>'Rainbow Syndication Login','AppKey'=>'AppKey','启用的登录方式'=>'Enabled Login Method','microsoft'=>'microsoft','彩虹聚合登录为第三方登录平台，一般是由个人自己搭建。或者使用现成的第三方，不过第三方一旦停止服务，您的用户将无法再次登录您的网站，所以请根据自己的需求选择。具体搭建和使用方法，请自行百度。'=>'Rainbow Syndication login is a third-party login platform, which is usually built by individuals themselves. Or use a ready-made third party, but once the third party stops serving you, your users will not be able to log in to your website again, so please choose according to your needs. For details on how to build and use this platform, please contact Baidu。','用户默认头像'=>'User default avatar','用户默认封面'=>'User default cover','加密用户页面网址'=>'Encrypted user page URL','加密前：%s%s加密后：%s%s设置完成以后请保存一下固定链接，前端用户需要重新登录'=>'Before encryption: %s %s After encryption: %s %s After setting, please save the fixed link, the front-end user needs to log in again','加密'=>'encryption','不加密'=>'No encryption','重写用户页面规则'=>'Rewrite user page rules','如果需要用户页面是%s，则在此处填写%s%s设置完成以后请保存一下固定链接，前端用户需要重新登录'=>'If you want the user page to be %s, fill in %s %s here, after setting, please save the fixed link for the front-end user needs to log in again','是否显示用户描述'=>'Whether to display the user description','经常有人利用用户描述来填写广告和垃圾信息，如果您用不上用户描述，建议关闭'=>'User descriptions are often used to fill out advertisements and spam, so if you don\'t use them, we recommend turning them off.','普通用户等级设置%s（LV0等级必须设置积分为0，否则新用户没有等级提示，请不要删除或随意改变下面等级的排序，也不要随意在中间插入新的等级，否则可能造成老用户的等级失效。）%s'=>'Ordinary user level setting %s (LV0 level must set points to 0, otherwise there will be no level prompt for new users. Please do not delete or change the order of the following levels at will, and do not insert new levels in the middle at will, otherwise it may cause the level of old users Invalid.) %s','添加新等级'=>'Add new level','删除等级'=>'delete level','确定要删除这个等级吗？'=>'Are you sure to delete this level？','该等级的对外名称'=>'The external name of this level','比如 %s 等等'=>'For example, %s etc','到达此等级需要的积分'=>'Points required to reach this level','比如 %s 积分，用户会达到此积分便会升级为此等级'=>'For example, if the user reaches %s points, he will be upgraded to this level','允许每天下载的次数'=>'Times that allowed to download per day','为防止有人恶意采集下载资源，可在此处设置允许每天下载的次数。如果当天下载次数达到最大，将不允许再次下载。（如果下载次数大于或等于9999，系统将识别为不限制下载次数）'=>'To prevent someone from maliciously collecting download resources, you can set the number of downloads allowed per day here. If the number of downloads reaches the maximum for the day, no further downloads will be allowed. (If the number of downloads is greater than or equal to 9999, the system will recognize that there is no limit to the number of downloads)','该等级的权限'=>'This level of authority','付费用户等级设置%s（请不要随意删除或改变下面等级的排序，也不要随意在中间插入新的等级，否则可能造成老用户的等级失效。）%s'=>'Paid user level settings %s (Please do not delete or change the order of the following levels at will, and do not insert new levels in the middle, otherwise the levels of old users may become invalid.) %s','该等级的对外显示的颜色'=>'The externally displayed color of this level','购买此等级需要支付的费用'=>'The cost of buying this level','比如 %s 元，用户支付了这些费用，便会成为此等级用户，如果设置为0将不允许用户购买'=>'For example, %s USD. Users will reach the corresponding level after paid. Users are unable to pay if you set it to 0','该等级的有效期'=>'The validity period of this level','此处为用户从购买会员到会员过期的时间，比如 %s 天，请直接填写天数的数字，永久有效请填0。'=>'Here is the time from when the user purchases the member until the member expires, such as %s days, please fill in the number of days directly. Fill in 0 will set permanently Valid。','是否允许查看所有隐藏内容'=>'Whether to allow viewing of all hidden content','禁止'=>'Ban','对文章中隐藏代码包裹起来的内容有效'=>'Effective for content wrapped in hidden code in articles','是否允许下载所有资源'=>'Whether to allow downloading of all resources','将会允许此等级用户免费下载所有文章中设置的下载资源'=>'Will allow users of this level to download all the download resources set in the articles for free','是否允许查看所有付费视频'=>'Whether to allow viewing of all paid videos','将会允许此等级用户免费查看所有付费视频内容'=>'Users of this level will be allowed to view all paid video content for free','初始人数'=>'Initial number of people','新站vip购买页面显示VIP数量太少，这里可以设置一个初始数量，让数据看上去漂亮一些'=>'The VIP purchase page of the new site shows that the number of VIPs is too small. You can set an initial number here to make the data look better','自定义权限'=>'Custom permissions','%s在vip购买页面每个等级都会有相应的权限，如果您自己还给了这个等级其他权限，可以在这里自定义，每个权限占一行，比如：%s参与本站线下活动|0%s100天售后服务|0%s其中竖线和后面的0（|0 或|1）代表该等级是否有此权限，0代表无，1代表有%s'=>'%s will have corresponding permissions for each level on the VIP purchase page. If you have given other permissions to this level, you can customize them here. Each permission will occupy one line. For example: %s participates in offline activities on this site|0 %s100-day after-sales service|0%sThe vertical bar and the following 0 (|0 or |1) represent whether the level has this permission, 0 represents none, and 1 represents %s','投稿及媒体'=>'Submissions and media','是否允许用户投稿'=>'Whether to allow user contributions','允许投稿'=>'Contributions allowed','允许投稿的分类'=>'Categories that allow submission','请确保您的分类别名不是中文，否则无法选中，不选择将不显示分类设置的选项'=>'Please make sure that your category name is not in Chinese, otherwise it cannot be selected. If you do not select it, the category setting options will not be displayed','默认投稿的分类ID'=>'Default submission category ID','请直接填写分类ID，不设置则默认投入ID为1的分类中'=>'Please fill in the category ID directly. If you do not set it, it will be put into the category with ID 1 by default','允许投稿的%s'=>'%s allowed to contribute','请确保您的%s别名不是中文，否则无法选中，不选择将不显示%s设置的选项'=>'Please make sure that your %s alias is not in Chinese, otherwise it cannot be selected. If you do not select it, the options set by %s will not be displayed','默认投稿的%sID'=>'Default submission %sID','请直接填写%sID'=>'Please fill in %s ID directly.','是否允许发布下载'=>'Whether or not to allow the release of downloads','允许发布下载后，用户可以在前端投稿中发布下载资源'=>'After allowing the posting of downloads, users can post downloadable resources in the front-end submission','投稿自定义字段设置'=>'Submission custom field settings','投稿中的自定义字段，前端不会显示，需要站长自己写代码去使用自定义字段'=>'The custom fields in the submission will not be displayed on the front end. The webmaster needs to write the code to use the custom fields','自定义字段{#}'=>'Custom fields{#}','添加新的自定义字段'=>'Add new custom field','删除自定义字段'=>'Delete custom field','确定要删除这个自定义字段吗？'=>'Are you sure to delete this custom field？','自定义字段名称'=>'Custom field name','提示用户要设置的是什么，比如：%s水果%s'=>'Prompt the user what to set, for example: %s fruit %s','自定义字段key'=>'Custom field key','请使用英文，比如%sfruit_name%s（水果名称）'=>'Please use English, such as %s fruit_name %s (fruit name)','向用户说明这个选项如何使用，比如：%s请选择您喜欢的水果%s'=>'Explain to users how to use this option, for example: %s, please choose your favorite fruit %s','如果表单形式选择单选，或者多选，请填写待选值，否则请留空。每组值占一行，推荐使用%sapple=苹果%s这种形式，%sapple%s是存入数据库里的值，%s苹果%s是显示出来给用户看的（英文的值方便查找与管理）。比如：%sapple=苹果%sorange=橘子%s'=>'If the form is selected as single-choice or multiple-choice, please fill in the value to be selected, otherwise please leave it blank. Each set of values ​​occupies one line, it is recommended to use the form of %s apple = Apple %s, %s apple %s is the value stored in the database, %s Apple %s is displayed for what users see (English values ​​are easy to find and manage). For example: %s apple = Apple %s orange = Orange %s','媒体设置'=>'media settings','媒体设置全站生效'=>'Media settings take effect across the entire site','是否启用webp格式'=>'Whether to enable webp format','启用webp格式图片'=>'Enable webp format images','禁用webp格式图片'=>'Disable webp format images','webp格式的图片可以大量节省您的宽带，优化网站打开速度。建议开启。如果您使用的远程图片，则不能支持。'=>'images in webp format can save a lot of your bandwidth and optimize website opening speed. It is recommended to turn it on. If you are using remote images, this is not supported。','图片网址批量替换'=>'Batch replacement of image URLs','启用裁剪'=>'Enable cropping','禁止裁剪'=>'No cropping','是否允许自动裁剪缩略图'=>'Whether to allow automatic cropping of thumbnails','裁剪缩略图可以大量节省您的宽带，优化网站打开速度。建议开启。如果您使用的远程图片，则不能支持。'=>'Cropping thumbnails can save a lot of your bandwidth and optimize website opening speed. It is recommended to turn it on. If you are using remote images, this is not supported。','是否开启懒加载功能'=>'Whether to enable lazy loading','此设置全站生效'=>'This setting takes effect across the entire site','哪些等级允许上传图片？'=>'Which levels allow uploading images？','这里设置以后，全站生效，选择之后，只有这些等级允许上传图片'=>'After setting here, it will take effect for the whole site. After selection, only these levels are allowed to upload pictures','允许上传图片的最大体积'=>'Maximum size of images allowed to be uploaded','这里设置以后，全站生效，全站的图片体积都不允许超过此范围，单位是M，请直接填写数字'=>'After setting here, it will take effect for the entire site. The image size of the entire site is not allowed to exceed this range. The unit is M. Please fill in the number directly','哪些等级允许上传视频？'=>'Which levels allow uploading videos？','这里设置以后，全站生效，选择之后，只有这些等级允许上传视频'=>'After setting here, it will take effect for the entire site. After selection, only these levels are allowed to upload videos','允许上传视频的最大体积'=>'Maximum size of video allowed to be uploaded','这里设置以后，全站生效，全站上传的视频体积都不允许超过此范围，单位是M，请直接填写数字'=>'After setting here, it will take effect for the entire site. The volume of videos uploaded by the entire site is not allowed to exceed this range. The unit is M. Please fill in the number directly','哪些等级允许上传文件？'=>'Which levels allow uploading files？','这里设置以后，全站生效，选择之后，只有这些等级允许上传文件'=>'After setting here, it will take effect for the entire site. After selection, only these levels are allowed to upload files','允许上传文件的最大体积'=>'Maximum size of files allowed to be uploaded','这里设置以后，全站生效，全站上传的文件体积都不允许超过此范围，单位是M，请直接填写数字'=>'After setting here, it will take effect for the entire site. The file size uploaded by the entire site is not allowed to exceed this range. The unit is M. Please fill in the number directly','是否开启paypal'=>'Whether to enable paypal','第三方支付不能保证100%安全，我们只对接口做兼容，其他请自行负责。请不要使用个人支付接口从事违法活动，否则删除授权，并向公安机关举报'=>'Third-party payment cannot be guaranteed to be 100% safe. We only make the interface compatible, and please be responsible for the rest. Please do not use the personal payment interface to engage in illegal activities, otherwise the authorization will be deleted and reported to the public security agency','支付宝官方（推荐使用）'=>'Alipay official (recommended)','迅虎支付（支持H5支付）（推荐使用）'=>'Xunhu Payment (supports H5 payment) (recommended)','虎皮椒支付'=>'tiger pepper payment','payjs支付'=>'payjs payment','xorpay支付'=>'xorpay payment','易支付'=>'Easy to pay','微信官方（推荐使用）'=>'WeChat official (recommended)','支付方式'=>'Payment method','常规方式'=>'conventional way','当面付'=>'Pay in person','如果你是支付宝企业账户，推荐使用常规方式，兼容性最好。如果您是个人用户只能选择当面付，当面付支持手机和移动端支付'=>'If you have Alipay corporate account, it is recommended to use the conventional method with the best compatibility. If you are an individual user, you can only choose pay in person, pay in person supports mobile and PC payment','支付宝官方支付设置'=>'Alipay official payment settings','APPID'=>'APPID','打开链接： https://open.alipay.com 账户中心->密钥管理->开放平台密钥，填写您支付的应用的APPID'=>'Open link: https://open.alipay.com Account Center-> Key Management-> Open Platform Key, fill in your support AppID of the paid application','应用私钥'=>'Apply private key','本主题使用的是 RSA2 算法生成的私钥。请使用 RSA2 算法来生成。'=>'This topic uses private keys generated by the RSA2 algorithm. Please use RSA2 algorithm to generate。','支付宝公钥'=>'Alipay public key','请在 账户中心->密钥管理->开放平台密钥，找到添加了支付功能的应用，根据你的加密类型，查看支付宝公钥。'=>'Please find the application with added payment function in Account Center-> Key Management-> Open Platform Key, according to your encryption Type, check Alipay public key。','API用户名'=>'API User Name','Paypal官方支付设置'=>'Paypal official payment settings','API密码'=>'API Password','签名'=>'Signature','是否开启沙箱模式'=>'Whether to enable sandbox mode','沙箱模式是PayPal支付的测试环境。如果开启沙箱模式，请使用沙箱环境生成的收款账户和付款账户进行测试。%s测试通过后生产环境使用时请关闭沙箱模式，上面PayPal收款Email请设置成真实的收款账户'=>'Sandbox mode is a testing environment for PayPal payments. If you enable sandbox mode, please use the collection account and payment account generated by the sandbox environment for testing. After %s passes the test, please turn off the sandbox mode when using it in the production environment. Please set the above PayPal payment email to a real payment account','结算货币'=>'Settlement Currency','请选择结算货币'=>'Please select settlement currency','汇率'=>'Exchange rate','转换成paypal支付货币的汇率，比如1人民币兑换0.1430美元，这里就填0.1430'=>'Convert to the exchange rate of PayPal payment currency, for example, 1 RMB to 0.1430 US dollars, fill in 0.1430 here','020pay付款方式'=>'020pay payment method','跳转页面支付'=>'Jump to payment page','二维码支付'=>'QR code payment','二维码支付需要您在020pay支付后台上传您对应的金额二维码，如果没有上传可能会无法回调，如果您之不知道怎么使用，建议直接用跳转模式'=>'QR code payment requires you to upload your corresponding amount QR code in the 020pay payment background. If it is not uploaded, the callback may not be possible. If you don’t know how to use it, it is recommended to use the jump mode directly','020pay支付设置（支持支付宝和微信）'=>'020pay payment settings (supports Alipay and WeChat)','identification'=>'identification','您的商户唯一标识，注册后在账号设置->API接口信息里获得'=>'Your merchant’s unique identifier can be obtained in Account Settings->API Interface Information after registration','token'=>'token','商户ID'=>'Merchant ID','请前往后台查看'=>'Please go to the backend to view','随便付设置'=>'Pay whatever you want to set up','商户Key'=>'Merchant Key','MCHID'=>'MCHID','进入迅虎支付平台，查看商户ID'=>'Enter the Xunhu payment platform and check the merchant ID','迅虎支付设置（支持支付宝和微信）'=>'Xunhu payment settings (supports Alipay and WeChat)','PRIVATE KEY'=>'PRIVATE KEY','进入迅虎支付平台，查看应用PRIVATE KEY'=>'Enter the Xunhu payment platform and view the application PRIVATE KEY','支付网关'=>'payment gateway','不知道这个做什么用的请保持默认即可，默认网关：https://admin.xunhuweb.com。迅虎支付申请地址：<a href="https://pay.xunhuweb.com" target="_blank">https://pay.xunhuweb.com</a>'=>'If you don’t know what this is used for, please keep the default gateway: https://admin.xunhuweb.com. Xunhu payment application address: <a href="https://pay.xunhuweb.com" target="_blank">https://pay.xunhuweb.com</a>','appid'=>'appid','虎皮椒支付宝设置（支持支付宝支付）'=>'Hupijiao Alipay settings (supports Alipay payment)','appsecret'=>'appsecret','留空则使用默认网关，如无特别升级，请留空'=>'Leave it blank to use the default gateway. If there is no special upgrade, please leave it blank','虎皮椒微信支付设置（支持微信支付）'=>'Tiger Pepper WeChat Payment Settings (support WeChat Pay)','商户号'=>'Merchant ID','请登录payjs.cn会员中心查看'=>'Please log in to payjs.cn member center to view','payjs支付设置（支持支付宝和微信）'=>'payjs payment settings (supports Alipay and WeChat)','密钥'=>'key','请登录payjs.cn会员中心查看。'=>'Please log in to the payjs.cn member center to view。','您的易支付接口网址'=>'Your E-Payment Interface URL','易支付（支持支付宝和微信）'=>'Easy Pay (supports Alipay and WeChat)','商户KEY'=>'Merchant KEY','码支付付款方式'=>'Ma payment method','二维码支付需要您在码支付后台上传您对应的金额二维码，如果没有上传可能会无法回调，如果您之不知道怎么使用，建议直接用跳转模式'=>'QR code payment requires you to upload the QR code of your corresponding amount in the background of the Ma Payment. If you do not upload it, you may not be able to return, if you don’t know how to use it, it is recommended to use the jump mode directly','码支付设置（支持支付宝和微信）'=>'Ma Payment settings (supports Alipay and WeChat)','码支付ID'=>'Ma Payment ID','码支付后台->系统设置->码支付ID'=>'Ma Payment background-> System settings-> Ma Payment ID','通讯密钥'=>'communication key','码支付后台->系统设置->通讯密钥'=>'Ma Payment background-> System settings-> Communication key','aid'=>'aid','xorpay 后台，应用配置中查看'=>'xorpay background, view in App configuration','xorpay支付设置（支持支付宝和微信）'=>'xorpay Payment settings (supports Alipay and WeChat）','app appsecret'=>'app appsecret','进入微信公众平台（服务号）->左侧菜单最下面->基本配置->开发者ID(AppID)'=>'Enter WeChat public platform (Service number)-> Bottom left menu-> Basic configuration-> Developer ID (AppID)','微信官方支付设置'=>'WeChat official payment settings','微信支付商户号'=>'WeChat Pay Merchant ID','进入微信商户平台->商户信息->基本信息->商户号，'=>'Enter the WeChat merchant platform->Merchant information->Basic information->Merchant number，','商户支付密钥'=>'Merchant Payment key','进入微信商户平台->API安全->API密钥(v2)'=>'Go to WeChat Merchant Platform->API Security->API Key(v2)','财富'=>'Wealth','是否允许余额充值'=>'Whether to allow balance top-ups','禁止充值'=>'Prohibition of top-ups','允许充值'=>'Allowed to recharge','余额设置'=>'Balance Setting','请务必要做一定的限制，否则接口可能会被坏人利用。'=>'Be sure to make certain restrictions or the interface may be exploited by the bad guys.','每天最大的充值次数'=>'Maximum number of reloads per day','填写数字，比如填2，则限制每天只能充值两次'=>'Fill in the number, for example, fill in 2, then you can only top up twice a day','每次充值的最大金额'=>'Maximum amount per recharge','每次充值的金额不能大于此数，请直接填数字，比如100，则每次充值不允许超过100'=>'The amount of each recharge can not be greater than this number, please fill in the number directly, for example, 100, then each recharge is not allowed to exceed 100','是否允许提现'=>'Is withdrawal allowed','允许提现'=>'Withdrawal allowed','提现设置'=>'Set withdrawal','%s超过多少允许提现'=>'%s exceeds the amount allowed to withdraw money','用户%s大于或者等于这个金额方可允许提现'=>'User %s must be greater than or equal to this amount to allow withdrawals','网站提成比例'=>'Website commission ratio','默认 0.05 （5%），如果网站不抽成，请设置为0。'=>'The default number is 0.05 (5%). Please set it to 0 if there\'s no website commission。','是否允许卡密充值？'=>'Whether Card & Key recharge is allowed？','禁止使用'=>'Prohibited use','允许使用'=>'with permission','卡密充值设置'=>'Card & Key Recharge Setting','卡密充值弹窗提示信息'=>'Card & Key recharge popup prompt message','通常用来提示用户去哪购买的文字'=>'Text usually used to prompt users where to buy','是否允许购买积分'=>'Whether the purchase of points is allowed','禁止购买'=>'prohibition on purchase','允许购买'=>'Allowed to purchase','每天最大的购买次数'=>'Maximum number of purchases per day','填写数字，比如填2，则限制每天只能购买两次'=>'Fill in a number, e.g. 2, to limit the purchase to two times per day','每次购买的最大金额'=>'Maximum amount per purchase','每次购买的金额不能大于此数，请直接填数字，比如100，则每次购买不允许超过100'=>'The amount of each purchase can not be greater than this number, please fill in the number directly, for example, 100, then each purchase is not allowed to exceed 100','1元人民币兑换多少积分'=>'How many points can be exchanged for 1 USD','默认1元兑换38积分'=>'By default, 1 USD is exchanged for 38 points','多少元起兑'=>'Minimum redeem limit (usd)','默认10元起兑'=>'Default redeem amount is 10 USD','新用户注册'=>'New User Registration','奖励对象：注册者。默认260分。首次注册时奖励。'=>'Bonus object: Registrants. Default number is 260 points. Rewards for first registration。','积分奖励'=>'Points awarded','如果不允许奖励积分，请设置为0'=>'If bonus points are not allowed, set to 0','发表文章'=>'publish an article','奖励对象：文章作者。默认200分。草稿状态不算，只有审核通过才算'=>'Bonus object: Article author. Default number is 200 points. The draft status is not counted, only after the review is passed','评论奖励'=>'Comment rewards','奖励对象：发表评论者。默认20分。（此评论积分设置包含站内所有的评论）'=>'Rewards: Reviewers. The default is 20 points. (This comment points setting includes all comments on the site)','文章（帖子）被评论奖励'=>'Articles (posts) are rewarded by comments','奖励对象：文章（帖子）作者。默认5分。'=>'Reward objects: Article (post) authors. The default is 5 points。','评论被点赞'=>'Comment are liked','奖励对象：评论作者。取消点赞评论作者会扣除相应的积分，默认5分。（此评论积分设置包含站内所有的评论）'=>'Rewards: Review authors. If the author of a like or comment is cancelled, the corresponding points will be deducted. The default is 5 points. (This comment points setting includes all comments on the site)','关注或被关注'=>'follow or be followed','奖励对象：点击关注的人或被关注的人，取消关注会扣除相应的积分。默认5分。'=>'Bonus object: When user who follow others or be followed will get this bonus. Unfollowing will deduct corresponding points. Default number is 5 points。','被点赞'=>'Liked','文章、%s话题、等被点赞。奖励对象：文章（或帖子）作者，如果取消点赞会扣除相应的积分。默认10分。'=>'Articles, %s topics, etc. were liked. Reward object: The author of the article (or post). If you cancel the like, the corresponding points will be deducted. The default is 10 points。','发布%s帖子'=>'Post %s','奖励对象：帖子作者。默认50分。'=>'Rewards: Post author. The default is 50 points。','发布%s'=>'Add New %s','发布%s，并且已经审核通过，奖励对象：发布%s的人。默认20分。'=>'Published %s, and it has been approved. Reward object: the person who published %s. The default is 20 points。','奖励对象：当前登录用户，登录用户每日签到将会随机获得积分，如果是固定值请使用 xx-xx 例如 100-100（中间横杠不可缺失）。'=>'Bonus object: Current logged-in user. The logged-in user will randomly receive points for daily sign-in, if it is a fixed value, please use xx-xx for example 100-100 (middle horizontal bar cannot be missing) 。','签到填坑倍数'=>'Sign in and fill in the pit multiples','请参考%s填坑说明%s'=>'Please refer to %s pit filling instructions %s','任务'=>'Task','任务次数'=>'Number of tasks','连续签到N天，奖励N积分'=>'Sign in for N days in a row and you will be rewarded with N points','想要用户连续签到3天，并且奖励100积分，则直接填3|100，如果不奖励，请之直接填0'=>'If you want the user to sign in for 3 consecutive days and be rewarded with 100 points, please directly fill in 3|100. If you do not want to be rewarded, please directly fill in 0','微信设置'=>'WeChat settings','微信公众号appid'=>'WeChat public account AppID','填写此信息，您的网站将和微信公众号深度整合（%s必须为微信认证了的服务号，订阅号没有此功能）%s'=>'Fill in this information, and your website will be deeply integrated with the WeChat official account (%s must be a service account certified by WeChat, subscription accounts do not have this function) %s','微信公众号appsecret'=>'WeChat public account AppSecret','进入微信公众平台（服务号）->左侧菜单最下面->基本配置->开发者密码(AppSecret)'=>'Enter WeChat public platform (Service number)-> Bottom left menu-> Basic configuration-> Developer password (AppSecret)','公众号自动回复'=>'Public autoresponder','Token'=>'Token','EncodingAESKey'=>'EncodingAESKey','公众号菜单'=>'Public Menu','微信菜单Json数据'=>'WeChat menu Json data','微信模板消息'=>'WeChat Template Message','是否开启微信模板消息'=>'Whether to enable WeChat template messages','接收通知的管理员ID'=>'Admin ID to receive notifications','如果站点内有新的交易，管理员会收到通知，请填写收取通知的管理员ID，前提是这个管理员必须绑定了微信登陆！'=>'If there is a new transaction in the site, the administrator will receive a notification. Please fill in the administrator ID that receives the notification. The premise is that the administrator must be bound to WeChat to log in！','邮件消息开关'=>'Mail Message Switch','使用此功能的前提是，wp中安装了邮件发送插件，安装方法请自行百度“wordpress邮件发送插件”，频繁发送邮件，可能会被收件服务器列为垃圾邮件，所以发送频率过高的邮件，建议选择关闭'=>'The premise of using this feature is, wp installed in the mail sending plug-ins, installation method, please baidu "wordpress mail sending plug-ins", frequent sending of mail, may be received by the server as spam, so the frequency of sending too much mail, it is recommended that you choose to close!','管理员收件邮箱'=>'Administrator Inbox','请填写管理员的邮箱，用于收取发给管理员的通知邮件'=>'Please fill in the administrator\'s email address to receive notification emails sent to the administrator.','有待审的文章、帖子、快讯、问答、供求、导肮等通知管理员'=>'Notify the administrator of pending articles, posts, newsletters, Q&A, supply and demand, guides, etc.','文章、帖子、快讯、问答、供求、导航等审核成功通知作者'=>'Notify authors of successful review of articles, posts, newsletters, Q&A, supply and demand, navigation, etc.','用户购买会员给管理员通知'=>'Notifications to administrators from users purchasing memberships','用户使用自定义支付通知管理员'=>'Users notify administrators using customized payments','用户置顶供求给管理员通知'=>'Notification to administrators of user\'s top offers and requests','商品购买通知管理员'=>'Product Purchase Notification Administrator','打赏通知文章作者'=>'Reward notification for article authors','充值通知管理员'=>'Recharge Notification Administrator','隐藏内容购买通知文章作者'=>'Hidden Content Purchase Notification for Article Authors','下载通知文章作者'=>'Download notification to article authors','积分购买通知管理员'=>'Points Purchase Notification Administrator','视频购买通知文章作者'=>'Video Purchase Notification Article Author','认证申请通知管理员'=>'Certification Application Notification Administrator','认证审核通过，通知申请者'=>'Certification review is approved and applicants are notified','加入付费圈子通知圈主'=>'Join a paid circle to notify circle owners','圈子付费查看回答通知答主'=>'Circle pay to view answers notify respondent','圈子付费查看通知帖子作者'=>'Circle Paid View Notification Post Author','订单统计'=>'Order statistics','订单管理'=>'Order Management','快递接口信息'=>'Express interface information','目前我们集成了易源数据的快递查询业务，请前往阿里云[%s全球物流快递查询_易源数据%s]然后购买（可0元购买试用），并将生成的key填写到下面设置项中（如果已经购买过，请前往阿里云市场买家中心查看）。'=>'At present, we have integrated the express query business of USD Data. Please 