','是否允许游客购买'=>'Whether Visitors are allowed to purchase','如果是支付费用查看视频，您可以开启游客支付功能。只支持支付费用可见。'=>'If you want to pay to view the video, you can turn on the guest payment function. Only payment fees are visible。','需要支付的金额'=>'Amount to be paid','请直接填写数字，比如%s元'=>'Please fill in the number directly, for example %s USD','需要支付的积分'=>'Points to be paid','请直接填写数字，比如%s积分'=>'Please fill in the numbers directly, such as %s points','允许查看的用户组'=>'User groups allowed to view','请选择允许查看视频的用户组'=>'Please select a user group that is allowed to view the video','是否允许自动播放'=>'Whether to allow autoplay','自动播放'=>'Autoplay','禁止自动播放'=>'disable autoplay','如果设置自动播放，打开页面以后视频会自动播放（因为浏览器的特殊配置，不能保证所有环境都能自动播放）'=>'If automatic playback is set, the video will automatically play after opening the page (because of the special configuration of the browser, it cannot be guaranteed all environments can play automatically)','视频设置'=>'Video settings','视频{#}'=>'video{#}','添加新视频'=>'Add new video','删除视频'=>'Delete video','确定要删除这个视频吗？'=>'Are you sure you want to delete this video？','Dogecloud 视频ID'=>'Dogecloud video ID','如果您使用了 <a href="https://www.dogecloud.com/" target="_blank">Dogecloud</a>，可以通过视频ID直接获取视频信息，前提是已经设置了两个key：<a target="_blank" href="'=>'If you use <a href="https://www.dogecloud.com/" target="_blank">Dogecloud</a>, you can directly obtain video information through the video ID, provided that two keys have been set: <a target="_blank" href="','视频标题'=>'video title','视频的标题，比如%s，如果此标题上面有总标题，请使用英文竖号分割一下，比如%s'=>'The title of the video, such as %s. If there is a general title above this title, please use English vertical symbols to separate it, such as %s','视频的封面，可以直接上传到媒体库，或者复制连接到此处'=>'The cover of the video can be uploaded directly to the media library. Or you can copy Link here','视频预览地址'=>'Video preview address','添加视频'=>'add video','用户未支付或者权限不足的情况下可以进行视频预览，如果没有支付限制，请留空（只支持类似 .mp4这种文件形式，不支持优酷等其他第三方）'=>'Video preview can be performed if the user has not paid or has insufficient permissions. If there is no payment restriction, please leave it blank (only file formats such as .mp4 are supported, and other third parties such as Youku are not supported)','请上传视频，或者直接输入视频地址，或直接粘贴视频网站的页面网址到此处。此为必填，否则前台无法播放视频。（支持类似 .mp4这种文件，支持B站视频、腾讯视频、西瓜视频、Youtube）'=>'Please upload a video, or enter the video address directly, or directly paste the video page URL of Station B here. This is required, otherwise the front desk cannot play the video. (Only supports files like .mp4, or Bilibili videos, and does not support third parties such as Youku)','是否显示标签'=>'Whether to display labels','隐藏'=>'Less','使用全局设置'=>'Use global settings','如果开启，将会显示在文章页面底部。使用全局设置，将会调用模块设置->文章内页中的相关设置'=>'If enabled, it will be displayed at the bottom of the article page. Using global settings, it will call the module settings->  Related settings on the inner page of the article','是否显示语音朗读'=>'Whether to display voice reading','如果开启，将会显示在文章页面内容顶部。使用全局设置，将会调用模块设置->文章内页中的相关设置'=>'If enabled, it will be displayed at the top of the article page content. Using global settings will call the module settings-> Related settings on the inner page of the article','是否显示侧边栏小工具'=>'Whether to show sidebar widgets','使用全局设置，将会调用模块设置->文章内页中的相关设置'=>'Using global settings, will call the Module settings-> Related settings on the inner page of the article','是否使用主题自带文章内图片点击放大功能'=>'Whether or not to use the theme comes with an in-post image click-to-enlarge feature','文章顶部广告位代码'=>'Ad slot code at the top of the article','如果不设置广告位请留空'=>'Leave blank if you don\'t set up Ad slots','文章低部广告位代码'=>'Advertising code at the bottom of the article','使用默认设置'=>'Use default settings','推广设置中有一个总开关，使用默认设置则总开关生效，如果在此设置则优先生效'=>'There is a master switch in the promotion settings. If you use the default settings, the master switch will take effect. If you set it here, it will take effect first','限购设置'=>'limit on purchase','限购数量'=>'limit on the number of units that can be purchased','如果设置为0或留空，则不限限制购买，否则请直接填写数字，比如每人限购10件，则填写10。'=>'If you set it to 0 or leave it blank, there is no limit to restrict the purchase, otherwise please fill in the number directly, for example, if there is a limit of 10 pieces per person, then fill in 10.','限购时间（天）'=>'Time limit for purchase (days)','如果设置为0或留空，则限购无时间限制。如果限购活动限制在2天内，则直接填2，第三天将停止限购，以此类推。到期后会重新计算。'=>'If set to 0 or left blank, there is no time limit on the limited purchase. If the limited purchase activity is limited to 2 days, simply fill in 2. The limited purchase will stop on the third day, and so on. It will recalculate after expiration.','隐藏内容阅读权限'=>'Hidden content reading permissions','阅读权限'=>'Wrong Amount Setting','需要在文章中使用隐藏内容短代码工具将需要隐藏的内容包裹起来，否则不生效'=>'You need to use the hidden content shortcode tool to wrap the content that needs to be hidden in the article, otherwise it will not take effect','如果是支付费用查看隐藏内容，您可以开启游客支付功能。只支持支付费用查看。'=>'If you want to pay to view hidden content, you can turn on the visitor payment function. Only payment is supported for viewing。','请选择允许查看隐藏内容的用户组'=>'Please select a user group that is allowed to view hidden content','默认查看人数'=>'Default number of viewers','如果隐藏内容为付费或者支付积分，没有人购买时会显示0人购买，不太好，此数据相当于伪造了付费用户的数量'=>'If the hidden content is paid or paid points, when no one buys, it will show 0 people buying, which is not good. This data is equivalent to forging the number of paying users','时效设置'=>'Aging settings','用户购买以后，多少小时后过期（过期后不能再次查看付费内容，需要再次购买），请直接填写小时数字，支持小数。比如%s，%s。如果此处留空不设置，用户购买以后，永久生效。此项设置只对积分阅读或者付费阅读生效。'=>'After the user purchases, how many hours will it expire (after expiration, the paid content cannot be viewed again and needs to be purchased again). Please directly fill in the hour number, decimals are supported. For example, %s, %s. If you leave this field blank and do not set it, it will take effect permanently after the user purchases it. This setting only takes effect for points reading or paid reading。','自定义海报图片'=>'Custom poster image','如果不设置，将自动使用本文特色图，如果没有设置特色图，自动使用文章中第一张图片，都没有则使用主题自带默认图片'=>'If it is not set, the feature map of this article will be used automatically. If feature map is not set as well, the first picture in the article will be used automatically. If neither of them are set, use the theme\'s own default picture','如果您开通并认证了微信服务号，并且主题中设置了相关功能（%s微信设置%s），用户在微信中回复此关键词，将会自动返回此文章。'=>'If you have opened and authenticated a WeChat service account and set up relevant functions in the theme (%sWeChat settings %s), users who reply to this keyword in WeChat will automatically return to this article。','该文章的弹出%s'=>'Pop-up %s for this article','%s标题'=>'%sTitle','支持 HTML，尽量短小才好看。'=>'Support HTML, try to be as short as possible to look good。','%s内容'=>'%s','支持 HTML，用户每次打开该文章都会显示此%s，如果不需要显示，请留空。'=>'Supports HTML. This %s will be displayed every time the user opens the article. If you do not need to display it, please leave it blank。','弹窗%s显示条件'=>'Pop-up window %s display conditions','所有人可见'=>'Everyone can see','登录用户可见'=>'Visible to logged-in users','未登录用户可见'=>'Visible to unlogged-in users','不显示弹窗'=>'Do not show pop-ups','弹窗间隔时间'=>'Pop-up window interval','如果没有新的%s，弹出一次用户关闭后再隔多少天再次弹出'=>'If there is no new %s, how many days will it take to pop up again after the user closes it once','旧%s多少天后自动关闭弹出'=>'How many days will it take for the old %s to automatically close the pop-up','如果没有新的%s发布，旧的%s多少天以后会自动失效，不再弹出。'=>'If no new %s is released, the old %s will automatically expire after a number of days and will no longer pop up。','来源地址'=>'Source address','%s来源地址'=>'%s source address','文章来源'=>'Article Source','文章来源网址'=>'Article source URL','文章来源站点名称'=>'Article source site name','下载设置'=>'Download settings','是否开启下载功能？'=>'Do you want to enable the download function？','如果是支付费用下载，您可以开启游客支付功能。只支持支付费用下载。'=>'If you are paying to download, you can turn on the guest payment function. Only paid downloads are supported。','不选择'=>'Don\'t choose','资源{#}'=>'resource{#}','添加一个资源项'=>'Add a resource item','删除资源'=>'Delete resources','确定要删除这个资源吗？'=>'Are you sure you want to delete this resource？','选择模版'=>'Select template','您可以前往%s页面创建下载模版，在此处可以选择设置好的模版，然后直接编辑，方便快速设置'=>'You can go to the %s page to create a downloadable template, where you can select a set template and then edit it directly for quick and easy setup','下载模版设置'=>'Download template settings','资源链接'=>'Resource links','格式为%s，每组占一行。%s比如：%s%s提取码标识为：tq，解压码标识为：jy，如果中需要其中一个，只设置一个即可，都没有可以不用设置'=>'The format is %s, and each group occupies one line. %s For example: %s %s The extraction code is identified as: tq, and the decompression code is identified as: jy, if only one of them is needed, then just set one. Don\'t set if you need none of them','资源缩略图'=>'Resource thumbnail','可以不设置，将自动显示封面图片'=>'Don\'t set if you don\'t need it, the cover picture will be displayed automatically','资源名称'=>'Resource Name','如果不设置，将获取文章标题当作资源名称'=>'The article title will be used as the resource name if you don\'t set one','演示地址'=>'Demo address','请填写网址形式，如果不设置，前台将不显示演示地址'=>'Please fill in the URL form. If not set, the demo address will not be displayed at the front desk','资源属性'=>'Resource properties','格式为%s，每组占一行。%s比如：%s'=>'The format is %s, each group occupies one line. %sFor example: %s','下载权限'=>'Download permission','格式为%s，比如%s权限参数：%s评论可见：comment%s登录可见：login%s无限制：free%s付费下载：money=10%s积分下载：credit=30%s特殊权限：%s所有人免费：all|free（或者credit=10这种格式）%s普通用户组免费：lv|free（或者credit=10这种格式）%sVIP用户免费：vip|free（或者credit=10这种格式）'=>'The format is %s, for example, %s permission parameter: %s comment is visible: comment %s login is visible: login %s unlimited: free %s paid download: money = 10%s point download: credit = 30 %s special permission: %s free for all: all|free (or credit=10) %s free for common user group: lv|free (or credit=10) %s free for VIP users: VIP|free （or credit=10）','文章在该组别的排序'=>'Articles sorted in this group','排序必填，否则%s分类中不显示，数字越小，排名越靠前'=>'Sorting is required, otherwise it will not be displayed in the %s category. The smaller the number, the higher the ranking','举报设置'=>'Report Setup','举报类型'=>'Type of report','请输入举报类型，每个类型占一行'=>'Please enter the type of report, one line for each type','举报列表'=>'Report List','您的举报已处理：%s'=>'Your report has been processed: %s','举报处理结果'=>'Reporting results','没有找到此举报'=>'Group Mods not found','查看评论'=>'Unable to view comments','举报内容：'=>'содержание донесения：','举报图片：'=>'Whistleblowing Picture:','举报连接：'=>'Whistleblower Connection:','举报人：'=>'Whistleblower:','邮箱：'=>'Email:','处理结果：'=>'результат：','处理状态：'=>'состояние рёшениизаказ','未处理'=>'Unprocessed','已处理'=>'Processed','搜索条目'=>'Search Entries','：您的举报已处理'=>': Your report has been processed','你的举报已处理：'=>'Your report has been processed:','感谢您的反馈！'=>'Thank you for registering!','未上传图片'=>'Upload Image','处理'=>'Process','举报ID'=>'Report ID','来自'=>'From','涉及的连接'=>'Connections involved','举报的内容'=>'The content of the report','举报的图片'=>'Reported Pictures','处理状态'=>'Processing Status','处理说明'=>'Handling instructions','举报者邮箱'=>'Whistleblower Email','工单ID'=>'ID of support ticket','回复状态'=>'reply status','邮箱'=>'Email','SEO设置'=>'SEO settings','SEO标题'=>'SEO title','SEO关键词'=>'SEO keywords','SEO描述'=>'SEO Description','是虚拟物品吗'=>'Is it a virtual item','是否允许游客购买虚拟物品'=>'Whether visitors are allowed to purchase virtual items','接收售后私信的ID'=>'ID to receive after-sales private messages','用户在前台订单中心里面点击售后服务按钮，会弹出私信框，此处设置是指定用户将售后私信发给谁'=>'When the user clicks the after-sales service button in the front-end order center, a private message box will pop up. The setting here is to specify who the user will send the after-sales private message to','%sSEO关键词'=>'%sSEO keywords','%sSEO关键词，多个关键词请用英文的逗号隔开，一般显示在页面标签内，做SEO用'=>'%sSEO keywords. Please separate multiple keywords with English commas. They are usually displayed in page tags and are used for SEO','%sSEO描述'=>'%sSEO description','%sSEO描述，一般显示在页面标签内，做SEO用'=>'%sSEO description, usually displayed in the page tag, used for SEO','%s首页幻灯内容'=>'%s homepage slideshow content','支持所有文章类型（文章，商品等），每组占一行，排序与此设置相同（不设置请留空）。图片可以在%s上传或选择。
