                 %s','%s首页幻灯设置'=>'%sSlideshow settings','%s首页幻灯高度'=>'%s home page slide height','%s首页幻灯是否显示标题'=>'Whether to display the title in the %s homepage slideshow','%s首页允许显示的商品分类'=>'Product categories allowed to be displayed on %s homepage','请确保您的分类别名不是中文，否则无法选中，全部取消将不显示'=>'Please make sure your category alias is not Chinese, otherwise it cannot be selected, and it will not be displayed if you cancel all','%s首页分类导航设置'=>'%scategory navigation settings','%s首页分类每行显示的数量'=>'The number displayed in each row of the %s homepage category','%s首页分类背景图比例'=>'%s homepage category background image proportion','要显示的产品类型'=>'Product type to display','%s首页商品设置'=>'%s product settings','每种类型显示多少个'=>'How many of each type are displayed','每行显示多少个商品'=>'Display several per line','%s首页商品购买标题'=>'%s Home page title','%s首页积分兑换标题'=>'%s Home page title','%s首页积分抽奖标题'=>'%s Home page title','商品多规格模板'=>'Product multi-specification template','创建'=>'Create','多规格模板设置（点击小箭头展开设置）'=>'Multi-specification template settings (click the small arrow to expand the settings)','模板{#}'=>'template{#}','添加新模板'=>'Add new template','删除模板'=>'Delete template','确定要删除这个模板吗？'=>'Are you sure you want to delete this template？','模板标题%s'=>'Template title %s','给这个模板起个名字'=>'Give this template a name','模板参数'=>'template parameters','格式为：%s，参数之间请使用小写的逗号分隔，比如：%s'=>'The format is: %s, please use lowercase commas to separate parameters, for example: %s','优惠劵创建'=>'Coupon creation','优惠劵面值'=>'Coupon face value','优惠劵领取有效期'=>'Validity period for coupon collection','请直接填入天数，永久有效请填写0，有效期从创建成功的那一刻开始计算，过期以后用户将无法领取，已经领取的用户可以在优惠劵使用有效期内进行使用。'=>'Please fill in the number of days directly, fill in 0 for permanent validity, the validity period starts from the moment of successful creation, users will not be able to receive coupons out of validity period. Users who have already received coupon can use it within the validity period。','优惠劵使用有效期'=>'Coupon validity period','请直接填入天数，永久有效请填写0，有效期从用户领取优惠劵的时刻开始计算，超过时效作废，并且不能再次领取。'=>'Please fill in the number of days directly, fill in 0 for permanent validity. The validity period starts from the moment of successful creation, coupons can not be used out of validity period and can not be received again。','允许领取的用户组'=>'User groups allowed to receive','请选择允许领取优惠劵的用户组，如果不选择，则所有人都可以领取'=>'Please select the user group that is allowed to receive coupons. If you do not select it, everyone can receive it','没有商品分类，请前往%s添加'=>'There is no product category, please go to %s to add it','请确保您的分类别名不是中文，否则无法选中。不选择则不限制使用，选中则只允许这些分类的产品使用优惠劵'=>'Please make sure your category alias is not Chinese, otherwise it cannot be selected. There will be no limit if you don\'t select. Coupons can only be used for products group that you selected','允许使用的单个商品'=>'Allowed individual products','请直接输入产品的ID，每个ID占一行。如果设置了此项，优惠劵将只允许此商品使用，否则此项不做为限制条件'=>'Please enter the product ID directly, each ID occupies one line. If this item is set, the coupon will only allow the use of this product, Otherwise this item is not a restriction','优惠劵列表'=>'Coupon list','优惠劵生成成功， 请前往%s查看。'=>'The coupon was generated successfully, please go to %s to view it。','购买方式'=>'Ways to purchase','如果选择虚拟物品，请在左下设置虚拟物品的相关参数'=>'If you choose virtual items, please set the relevant parameters of the virtual items in the lower left corner','允许购买（或抽奖，或兑换）的用户组'=>'User groups allowed to purchase (or draw, or redeem)','选择允许购买（或抽奖，或兑换）此商品的用户组后将只允许这些用户购买（或抽奖，或兑换），如果不选择所有人都可以购买（或抽奖，或兑换）'=>'After selecting the user group that is allowed to purchase (or draw, or redeem) this product, only these users will be allowed to purchase (or draw, or redeem). If you do not select, everyone can purchase (or draw, or redeem).','是否为多规格多价格商品'=>'Whether it is a product with multiple specifications and multiple prices','多规格商品'=>'Products with multiple specifications','单规格商品'=>'Single specification product','如果此产品只有一种规格，一个价格，请选择单规格商品。如果此产品有多个规格，多个价格，请选择多规格商品'=>'If this product has only one specification and one price, please select the single specification product. If this product has multiple specifications and multiple prices, please select the multi-specification product','多规格设置'=>'Multiple specification settings','多规格json参数'=>'Multi-specification json parameters','程序自动生成的JSON数据，禁止直接在此处编辑。您可以复制此JSON数据到其他商品中使用。'=>'JSON data automatically generated by the program is prohibited from being edited directly here. You can copy this JSON data to use in other products。','是否隐藏销售数量'=>'Whether to hide sales quantity','隐藏销售数量'=>'Hide sales quantity','显示销售数量'=>'Show sales quantity','商品设置'=>'Product settings','正常价格（必填）'=>'Regular price (required)','折后价格'=>'Price after discount','如果不设置此价格，请直接留空'=>'If you do not set this price, please leave it blank','会员价格'=>'Membership Price','如果是会员，优先使用会员价格，其次使用折后价格，如果会员价格和折后价格都没有设置，则默认使用正常价格。奖励积分是用户购买之后获得的积分奖励值。'=>'If you are a member, use the member price first, followed by the discounted price, if there is no member price or discounted price set, the default price is used by default. Reward points are the points reward value obtained after the user purchases。','外链商品'=>'External link products','如果此商品为外链商品，请直接在此处输入外链商品的连接，用户点击之后会进行跳转，一般用于淘宝客。'=>'If this product is an external link product, please directly enter the link of the external link product here. The user will jump after clicking. This is generally used for Taobao customers。','抽奖设置'=>'Drawing sets','命中率'=>'hit rate','默认0.01 即1%的命中率，请直接填写小数'=>'The default is 0.01, which is 1% hit rate. Please fill in the decimal directly','抽奖所需积分'=>'Points required for lottery draw','抽奖完成会扣除这些积分'=>'These points will be deducted after the draw is completed','商品原价'=>'Product original price','展示给用户，当前抽奖商品的原价是多少'=>'Display to the user what is the original price of the current lottery product','兑换所需积分'=>'Redeem required points','兑换完成会扣除用户的相应积分'=>'System will deduct the user\'s corresponding points when redemption completed','展示给用户，当前积分兑换的商品的原价是多少'=>'Show to the user what is the original price of the product that the current points are exchanged for','商品数量'=>'Quantity of Products','库存数量'=>'Stock quantity','已经出售或兑换数量：'=>'Quantity sold or redeemed：','虚拟物品购买结果'=>'Virtual item purchase results','虚拟物品类型'=>'Virtual item type','文本'=>'text','卡密'=>'Recharge Card & Key','直接展示的内容'=>'Directly displayed content','购买结果支持html，如果是复杂的HTML可能用户的邮件中无法显示，或被邮件服务器过滤，不过商品页面会正常显示购买结果。'=>'The purchase result supports html. If it is complex HTML, the user\'s email may not be displayed, or filtered by the email server, but the product page will normally display the purchase results。','发送到邮箱的内容'=>'Content sent to email','此项设置可以填写多条内容，用户购买以后按照从上到下的顺序发送，如果已经购买过，后面会变成%s的形式。请确保商品数量和此处卡密数量一致，否则可能出现超卖而又收不到卡密的情况。每一条内容占一行。比如：%s已经购买过会变成%s'=>'This setting can fill in multiple content, after the user purchases in accordance with the order from top to bottom, if you have already purchased once, it will become the form of %s later. Please make sure that the quantity of the product is the same as the quantity of the card &key here, otherwise overselling may occur the situation where the card & key cannot be received again. Each piece of content occupies one line. For example: %s has already been purchased and will become %s','商品属性'=>'Product Attribute','商品属性值'=>'Product attribute value','请按照%s属性名|属性值%s的格式设置商品属性，每个属性占一行，不填则不显示此项。比如%s%s颜色|红色%s尺码|30%s'=>'Please set the product attributes according to the format of %s attribute name | attribute value %s. Each attribute occupies one line. If not filled, this item will not be displayed. Such as%s %s color | red%s size | 30%s','商品图片'=>'product picture','更多展示图片'=>'More display pictures','这些图片会在商品页面顶部显示，可以设置多个'=>'These pictures will be displayed at the top of the product page, and multiple','Tax 设置'=>'Tax settings','如果需要批量设置多个分类的的筛选，您可以前往%s分类筛选批量设置%s中进行操作'=>'If you need to batch set filters for multiple categories, you can go to %s category filter batch settings %s to operate','请选择要显示的文章分类，可以拖动排序'=>'Please select the article category to be displayed, you can drag and sort','请选择要显示的专题，可以拖动排序'=>'Please select the topics to be displayed 