s。'=>'The ratio of the width and height of the thumbnails in [List Mode] on the mobile terminal, such as %s, %s。','PC端标题最多显示几行'=>'How many lines can the PC title display at most','如果设置成1，标题超过1行会显示省略号，如果设置2，标题超过2行会显示省略号，以此类推。'=>'If set to 1, an ellipsis will be displayed in the title if it exceeds 1 line. If it is set to 2, an ellipsis will be displayed in the title if it exceeds 2 lines, and so on。','移动端端标题最多显示几行'=>'How many lines can the mobile terminal title display at most','缩略图比例'=>'Thumbnail scale','缩略图高度自适应的情况下不生效，请填写宽和高的比例，比如%s，%s。'=>'It will not take effect when the thumbnail height is adaptive. Please fill in the ratio of width and height, such as %s, %s。','打开方式'=>'Open method','原窗口打开'=>'Open in Original window','新窗口打开'=>'Open in New window','meta选择'=>'meta selection','摘要'=>'Description','分类'=>'Sort','评论数量'=>'The number of comments','视频标签'=>'video tag','下载标签'=>'Download tags','隐藏内容标签'=>'Hidden Content','特色图'=>'Featured Image','显示在聚合页面的最顶端，尽量使用大图，以适应各种模式下的显示清晰'=>'Displayed at the top of the aggregated page, try to use large images to adapt to clear display in various modes','颜色'=>'Color','某些情况下，会使用此颜色作为存档名称的颜色'=>'In some cases this color is used as the color for archive names','是否显示侧边栏'=>'Whether to show the sidebar','显示侧边栏'=>'Show sidebar','隐藏侧边栏'=>'Hide sidebar','如果需要显示侧边栏，请前往外观->小工具里面，设置一下第一个侧边栏小工具，否则仍然不显示'=>'If you need to display the sidebar, please go to Appearance->Widgets and set the first sidebar widget, otherwise it will still not be displayed','分页方式'=>'Paging mode','传统分页（无ajax）'=>'Traditional paging (no ajax)','下拉无限加载'=>'Drop-down infinite loading','ajax分页加载'=>'ajax page loading','商品分类设置'=>'Product category settings','此为当前%s的期数，比如第二期，请直接填写2'=>'This is the current issue of %s. For example, for the second issue, please fill in 2 directly','文档设置'=>'Document Settings','%s标签封面图'=>'%s label cover image','显示在%s首页顶部的图片'=>'The image displayed at the top of %s\' homepage','%s标签描述'=>'%s tag description','显示在%s标签封面之上，%s标签之下'=>'Displayed above the %s label cover and below the %s label','%s类别'=>'%scategory','%s图标'=>'%sicon','请直接输入要设置成管理员的用户的ID'=>'Please directly enter the ID of the user you want to set as an administrator','%s形式'=>'%s form','免费%s'=>'Free %s','付费%s'=>'Pay %s','专属%s'=>'Exclusive %s','免费圈子任何人都可以申请加入；付费圈子需要缴纳一定的金额才能入圈；专属圈子只允许特定等级的用户入圈，具体策略请在下面设置。'=>'Anyone can apply for free circles; paid circles need to pay a certain amount of money to enter the circle; exclusive circles only allow users of a specific level to enter the circle, please set the specific strategy below.','如果是免费%s，请选择加入%s规则'=>'If it is free %s, please choose to join the %s rule','自由加入%s'=>'Free to join %s','用户需要审核加入%s'=>'User needs to be reviewed to join %s','如果是专属%s，请选择允许加入%s的用户组'=>'If it is exclusive to %s, please select the user group that is allowed to join %s','如果您修改了此权限，请前往%s%s设置%s中重置以下该%s的数据。%s如果没有用户组，请前往%s用户设置%s进行设置'=>'If you have modified this permission, please go to %s%s Settings %s to reset the following %s data. %sIf there is no user group, please go to %sUser Settings%s to set it up','如果是收费%s，请设置金额（有效期：永久有效）'=>'If it is charging %s, please set the amount (validity period: permanently valid)','如果是收费%s，请设置金额（有效期：按年付费）'=>'If it is charged %s, please set the amount (validity period: paid annually)','如果是收费%s，请设置金额（有效期：半年付费）'=>'If it is charging %s, please set the amount (validity period: paid half a year)','如果是收费%s，请设置金额（有效期：季度付费）'=>'If charging %s, please set the amount (validity period: quarterly payment)','如果是收费%s，请设置金额（有效期：按月付费）'=>'If it is charged %s, please set the amount (validity period: paid monthly)','请选择%s隐私'=>'Please select %sprivacy','%s内帖子公开显示'=>'Posts in %s are publicly displayed','%s内帖子只对%s开放'=>'Posts in %s are only open to %s','如果您修改了此权限，请前往%s%s设置%s中重置以下该%s的数据。%s公开显示：即便用户没有入群，也可以查看%s内帖子，同时也会在广场显示；只对%s开放：用户加入%s之后才能查看%s帖子，不对外开放。'=>'If you have modified this permission, please go to %s%s Settings %s to reset the following %s data. %s is publicly displayed: Even if the user is not in the group, they can still view the posts in %s, and they will also be displayed in the square; only open to %s: users can only view %s\'s posts after joining %s, and are not open to the public。','允许查看前几篇帖子'=>'Allow viewing of previous posts','如果此%s内帖子只对%s开放，您可以允许未加入的人查看前几篇帖子，如果不填写或者填写0，则未加入的人可查看的帖子数为0。'=>'If the posts in this %s are only open to %s, you can allow people who have not joined to view the previous posts, if you do not fill in or fill in 0, the number of posts that can be viewed by people who have not joined will be zero.','连接设置'=>'Connection settings','是否包含子链接分类中的链接'=>'Whether to include links in sub-link categories','如果此链接分类中有子链接分类，您可以选择是否显示子链接分类中的链接，注意，如果子链接分类特别多（大于20个）可能会有性能问题。'=>'If there are sub-link categories in this link category, you can choose whether to display the links in the sub-link category. Note that there may be performance problems if there are too many sub-link categories (more than 20)。','每页显示几个'=>'Show several per page','最后添加的排在前面'=>'Last added first','子链接分类'=>'Sub link classification','加载更多按钮'=>'load more button','帖子权限设置'=>'Post permission settings','%s帖子权限设置%s%s您可以在这里单独给某个帖子设置发布阅读权限等。%s'=>'%sPost permission settings%s%sYou can set the publishing and reading permissions for a specific post here. %s','如果使用全局设置，这里请选择全局设置，并且在主题设置->%s设置->话题设置中编辑全局权限'=>'If you use global settings, please select global settings here and edit global permissions in Theme Settings->%s Settings->Topic Settings','自定义该%s的发帖权限'=>'Customize the posting permissions of %s','模块管理'=>'Module management','页面宽度'=>'page width','请直接填写宽度数字，默认%s，不支持百分比。'=>'Please fill in the width number directly, the default is %s, and percentage is not supported。','字体设置'=>'Font settings','主题自带几款免费商用的中文字体，您可以选择关闭或者使用，中文字体体积比较大，选择之后可能会影响首屏展示速度。'=>'The theme comes with several free commercial Chinese fonts. You can choose to turn them off or use them. Chinese fonts are relatively large and may affect the display speed of the first screen。','oppo黑体'=>'oppo black body','鸿蒙黑体'=>'Hongmeng Blackbody','思源宋体'=>'Siyuan Song style','霞鹜文楷'=>'Xiahuo Wenkai','思源黑体'=>'Siyuan black body','字体使用默认CDN？'=>'Fonts using the default CDN?','使用默认CDN'=>'Using the default CDN','使用我自己的CDN'=>'Using my own CDN','字体文件默认的CDN使用的是jsdelivr.net的服务，某些情况下可能会出现无法加载的情况。如果您要使用自己的CDN，请设置一下下面的CDN地址'=>'The default CDN for font files uses the service jsdelivr.net, which may not load in some cases. If you want to use your own CDN, please set up the following CDN address','字体文件CDN地址'=>'Font File CDN Address','如果您需要将字体文件放到自己的CDN中，请先%s下载字体文件%s，解压后上传到您的CDN或者网站本地，然后在此处填写字体的链接目录，比如您将下载的字体文件放在<code>my/fonts/</code>目录下，那么此处填写<code>https://mycdn.com/my/fonts/</code>，注意最后要斜杠结尾'=>'If you need to put the font file into your own CDN, please download the font file %sfrom %s, unzip it and upload it to your CDN or website locally, then fill in the link directory of the fonts here, for example, if you put the downloaded font file into <code>my/fonts/</code> directory, then fill in <code>https://mycdn.com/my/fonts/</code> here <code>, and</code> pay attention to the slash at the end. End','侧边栏宽度'=>'sidebar width','请填写具体的数值，默认%s'=>'Please fill in the specific value, the default is %s','网站主色调'=>'Website main color','显示在按钮、链接等需要突出显示的地方。'=>'Displayed on buttons, links and other places that need to be highlighted。','网站背景颜色'=>'Website background color','网站全局背景图片'=>'Website global background image','不显示请留空'=>'Please leave blank if not displayed','网站全局背景图片是否重复'=>'Whether the global background image of the website is repeated','背景图片重复显示'=>'Background image repeats','背景图片不重复显示'=>'Background images are not displayed repeatedly','顶部模糊背景'=>'top blur background','圆角弧度'=>'fillet arc','全站生效的圆角弧度，默认%s，请带上单位%s'=>'The radius of the fillet that is valid for the whole site. The default is %s. Please bring the unit %s','是否开启代码高亮功能'=>'Whether to enable code highlighting','此设置全站生效，当代码被&lt;pre&gt;标签包裹起来之后，会自动启用代码高亮'=>'This setting takes effect throughout the site. When the code is wrapped by the &lt;pre&gt; tag, code highlighting will be automatically enabled','顶部'=>'Top','顶部背景颜色'=>'Top background color','顶部背景图片'=>'Top background image','顶部文字颜色'=>'Top text color','顶部二级菜单背景颜色'=>'Top secondary menu background color','顶部二级菜单文字颜色'=>'Top secondary menu text color','顶部布局形式'=>'top layout form','LOGO居中'=>'LOGO centered','LOGO居左'=>'LOGO on the left','菜单居中'=>'Center menu','LOGO居上'=>'LOGO top','社交类型菜单'=>'social type menu','页面顶部模块宽度'=>'Page top module width','可以使用%s、%s等符号，使用默认值请留空。'=>'Symbols such as %s, %s, etc. can be used, please leave the default values blank。','主题自带菜单功能'=>'Theme comes with menu function','如果您使用了菜单插件或者需要自己DIY顶部菜单代码而出现了兼容问题，请选择关闭主题自带的菜单功能。'=>'If you use a menu plug-in or need to DIY the top menu code and there is a compatibility problem, please choose to close the main menu function that comes with the question。','点击头像要显示的菜单'=>'Click on the avatar to display the menu','用户登陆状态下，点击头像要显示的菜单，支持拖放排序。'=>'When the user is logged in, click the avatar to display the menu, which supports drag-and-drop sorting。','私信列表'=>'Message','财富管理'=>'Wealth','推广中心'=>'Promotion','任务中心'=>'Task','成为会员'=>'VIP Member','认证服务'=>'Verify','我的订单'=>'My Order','我的设置'=>'Settings','请选择允许搜索的内容，可以拖动排序'=>'Please select the content that is allowed to be searched, and you can drag and sort it','模块{#}'=>'Module{#}','模块标题%s'=>'Module title %s','给这个模块起个名字，某些模块下会显示这个标题'=>'Give this module a name. This title will be displayed under some modules','模块key%s'=>'Module key%s','给这个模块起一个%s唯一的标识，纯小写字母，不要有空格或特殊字符%s，一般情况下不需要随意改动，这个key将和它对应的小工具挂钩，模块顺序变了以后不影响小工具的显示，如果改动这个值，它对应的小工具需要重新设置'=>'Give this module a unique identifier of %s, pure lowercase letters, no spaces or special characters %s. Under normal circumstances, there is no need to change it at will. This key will be linked to its corresponding gadget. It will not be affected if the module order is changed. The display of gadgets. If this value is changed, the corresponding gadgets need to be reset','模块描述'=>'Module description','某些模块下会显示这个描述'=>'This description will be displayed under some modules','是否开启此模块小工具'=>'Whether to enable this module gadget','如果设置开启，保存之后请去%s中对此模块小工具进行设置'=>'If the setting is turned on, please go to %s to set up this module gadget after saving it','此模块小工具是否跟随浏览器滚动'=>'Whether this module gadget follows browser scrolling','如果开启了小工具模块，此设置才会生效并只在PC端生效'=>'If the gadget module is enabled, this setting will take effect and will only take effect on the PC terminal','模块背景颜色'=>'Module background color','某些模块设置背景颜色会生效，如果不设置，显示默认背景颜色，请点击清空'=>'Setting the background color of some modules will take effect. If not set, the default background color will be displayed, please click to clear','模块背景图片'=>'Module background image','一些配置低的电脑或手机可能造成卡顿，请尽量上传提交较小的图片'=>'Some computers or mobile phones with low configuration may cause lag, please try to upload and submit smaller images','模块[更多]链接'=>'Module [more] link','自定义模块[更多]文字的链接，留空将默认输出文章类型首页网址'=>'Customize the link of the module [More] text. If left blank, the home page URL of the article type will be output by default','可见性'=>'visibility','桌面和移动端都显示'=>'Shown on both desktop and mobile','仅桌面可见'=>'Only visible on desktop','仅移动端可见'=>'Only visible on mobile devices','不显示（仅用作短代码调用）'=>'Only visible on mobile devices','幻灯'=>'Whether the title of the store\'s homepage slide shows the title','自定义'=>'Custom','调用内容'=>'Call content','请直接填写%s的分类ID，查看：%s链接分类%s'=>'Please directly fill in the category ID of %s and view: %s link category %s','是否包含子%s分类中的链接'=>'Whether to include links in the sub-category %s','如果此%s分类中有子%s分类，您可以选择是否显示子%s分类中的链接，注意，如果子%s分类特别多（大于20个）可能会有性能问题。'=>'如果此%s分类中有子%s分类，您可以选择是否显示子%s分类中的链接，注意，如果子%s分类特别多（大于20个）可能会有性能问题。','子%s分类'=>'Sub-%s classification','搜索标题'=>'Search title','搜索描述'=>'Search description','搜索框内描述文字'=>'Description text in the search box','文字颜色'=>'text color','允许搜索的分类'=>'Categories allowed to be searched','热门搜索关键词'=>'Popular search keywords','请输入关键词，每个关键词占一行，留空则不显示'=>'Please enter keywords. Each keyword occupies one line. If left blank, it will not be displayed','搜索模块的宽度'=>'Search module width','与页面同宽'=>'as wide as page',