loud AccessKey'=>'DogeCloud AccessKey','如果视频要使用 DogeCloud 请在此输入 DogeCloud AccessKey，请前往 %sDogecloud 后台%s查看。'=>'If the video uses DogeCloud, please enter the DogeCloud AccessKey here and go to %sDogecloud backend%s to view。','DogeCloud SecretKey'=>'DogeCloud SecretKey','如果视频要使用 DogeCloud 请在此输入 DogeCloud SecretKey，请前往 %sDogecloud 后台%s查看。'=>'If the video uses DogeCloud, please enter the DogeCloud SecretKey here and go to %sDogecloud backend%s to view。','文章内页底部版权申明设置'=>'Copyright statement settings at the bottom of the article page','设置之后将会显示在文章内容的底部，一般作为版权申明，支持html。留空则不显示。比如：%s'=>'After setting, it will be displayed at the bottom of the article content, usually as a copyright statement, and supports HTML. Leave blank to not display. For example: %s','是否启用上一篇，下一篇功能'=>'Whether to enable the %s function','文章内页中，是否显示上一篇，下一篇功能，关闭它可以提高运行速度。'=>'In the inner pages of articles, whether to display the previous article and next article function, turning it off can improve the running speed。','文章内页模块默认布局'=>'Default layout of article inner page module','如果您没有对单篇文章的布局进行设置，则此处设置默认生效'=>'If you have not set the layout for a single article, the settings here take effect by default','默认文章样式'=>'Default article style','优先显示文章中的此项设置，如果文章中未设置，则此处设置生效'=>'This setting in the article will be displayed first. If it is not set in the article, the setting here will take effect','文章底部广告位代码'=>'Ad slot code at the top of the article','打赏设置'=>'Tip settings','打赏的相关参数'=>'Relevant parameters for rewards','是否启用打赏功能'=>'Whether to enable the reward function','文章内页的打赏功能'=>'Tip function on the inner pages of articles','打赏别名'=>'Tip alias','打赏按钮前面的提示文字'=>'Prompt text in front of the reward button','打赏提示文字'=>'Tip text','没有打赏的提示文字'=>'No tip text','没有人打赏的时候，提示的文字'=>'When no one tips, the text of the prompt','默认打赏金额'=>'Default reward amount','请填写默认的金额，数量为5个，每个金额使用竖杠符号%s隔开，默认为%s'=>'Please fill in the default amount, the number is 5, each amount is separated by a vertical bar symbol %s, the default is %s','海报设置'=>'Po