ere is no need to pay points. You can enjoy everything as a member. It is more cost-effective to open a lifetime membership。','VIP会员是否无限次下载资源？'=>'Do VIP members have unlimited resource downloads？','在遵守VIP会员协议前提下，VIP会员在会员有效期内可以下载所有免费和VIP资源。'=>'Subject to the VIP membership agreement, VIP members can download all free and VIP resources during the membership period。','是否可以与他人分享VIP会员账号？'=>'Can I share my VIP membership account with others？','一个VIP账号仅限一个人使用，禁止与他人分享账号，一经发现做永久封号处理。'=>'A VIP account can only be used by one person. It is prohibited to share the account with others. Once discovered, the account will be permanently banned。','是否可以申请退款？'=>'Can I apply for a refund？','VIP会员属于虚拟服务，付款后不能够申请退款。如付款前有任何疑问，联系站长处理'=>'Vrgoo VIP members support refunds. If you are not satisfied within one hour after payment, you can contact customer service to apply for a refund','遇到付款失败，付款后没有生效怎么办？'=>'What should I do if my payment fails and the payment does not take effect？','理论上来说正常付款后不会出现此类问题，但是也会有部分用户因为网络等原因导致在付款的过程中会有一些小插曲，如果出现类似问题，大可不必惊慌，本站所有支付都会生成订单，不管成功还是失败，所以如果真正遇到网络问题导致付款失败您又不知道是否成功，请查看自己的个人中心的订单管理，截图联系管理员处理。'=>'Theoretically speaking, such problems will not occur after normal payment, but some users may have some hiccups during the payment process due to network and other reasons. If similar problems occur, such as membership not taking effect after payment, there is no need to panic. , all payments on this site will generate orders. Please contact vrgoo.org@gmail.com customer service with a payment screenshot or submit a work order. A specialist will contact you within two hours。','文章编辑过期，请返回重新发起编辑'=>'Article edits expired, please return to relaunch edits','文章不存在'=>'The article does not exist','请不要关闭此页，身份核实中...'=>'Please do not close this page, identity verifying ...','您还未获得发布文章的权限，请联系管理员'=>'You do not have permission to publish articles, please contact the Admin','添加题图'=>'Add feature image','添加下载附件'=>'Add download files','缩略图'=>'Thumbnail','请添加下载权限'=>'Download permission','请